#: about.php include/global_arrays.php include/top_general_header.php
#: include/top_header.php lib/html.php
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Kuhusu Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti imeundwa kuwa suluhisho kamili la uundaji wa grafu linalotegemea Hifadhidata ya Mfuatano wa Muda (TSDB) ya RRDtool na suluhisho la uundaji wa grafu. Lengo lake ni kurahisisha kazi ya Msimamizi wa Mtandao kwa kushughulikia maelezo yote muhimu yanayohitajika ili kuunda Grafu zenye maana."

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Tafadhali tazama %1$stovuti ya Cacti%2$s rasmi kwa maelezo kuhusu jinsi ya kutumia Cacti, kupata usaidizi, na masasisho."

#: about.php
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Wasanidi Programu Hai"

#: about.php
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Wasanidi programu wanaofanya kazi kwenye Cacti, Muundo wake, Nyaraka na Matoleo Yajayo."

#: about.php
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Waliotajwa kwa Heshima"

#: about.php
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Wachangiaji wa Nyaraka, QA, Upakiaji wa Vifurushi, Mijadala na ukurasa wetu wa YouTube."

#: about.php
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Wanachama Wastaafu"

#: about.php
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Wanachama wa Kundi la awali la Cacti ambao tangu wakati huo wameendelea na taaluma zao nyingine. Tunaendelea kuwatakia kila la kheri."

#: about.php
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Shukrani"

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Shukrani za pekee sana kwa %1$sTobi Oetiker%2$s, muundaji wa %3$sRRDtool%4$s na %5$sMRTG%6$s maarufu sana."

#: about.php
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Watumiaji wa Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Hasa yeyote ambaye ametenga muda kuunda ripoti ya tatizo, au kusaidia kurekebisha matatizo yanayohusiana na Cacti. Pia kwa yeyote ambaye amechangia katika kusaidia Cacti."

#: about.php
msgid "License"
msgstr "Leseni"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti imepewa leseni chini ya GNU GPL:"

#: about.php lib/installer.php
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Programu hii ni programu huria; unaweza kuisambaza tena na/au kuirekebisha chini ya masharti ya GNU General Public License kama ilivyochapishwa na Free Software Foundation; ama toleo la 2 la Leseni, au (kwa chaguo lako) toleo lolote la baadaye."

#: about.php
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Programu hii inasambazwa kwa matumaini kwamba itakuwa na manufaa, lakini BILA DHAMANA YOYOTE; hata bila dhamana iliyodokezwa ya UUZAJI au UFAAJI KWA MADHUMUNI MAALUM. Tazama GNU General Public License kwa maelezo zaidi."

