#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Bulk Walk Maximum Repetitions"
msgstr "Idadi ya Juu ya Marudio ya Bulk Walk"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "For SNMPv2 and SNMPv3 Devices, the SNMP Bulk Walk max-repetitions size. The default is to 'Auto Detect on Re-Index'. For very large switches, high performance servers, Jumbo Frame Networks or for high latency WAN connections, increasing this value may increase poller performance. More data is packed into a single SNMP packet which can reduce data query run time. However, some devices may completely refuse to respond to packets with a max-repetition size which is set too large. This can be especially true for lower-powered IoT type devices or smaller embedded IT appliances. Special attention to the overall network path MTU should also be considered since setting a value which is too high could lead to packet fragmentation."
msgstr "Kwa Vifaa vya SNMPv2 na SNMPv3, ukubwa wa juu wa marudio (max-repetitions) wa SNMP Bulk Walk. Chaguomsingi ni 'Tambua Kiotomatiki Wakati wa Kuorodhesha Upya'. Kwa swichi kubwa sana, seva za utendaji wa juu, Mitandao ya Jumbo Frame au miunganisho ya WAN yenye ucheleweshaji mkubwa, kuongeza thamani hii kunaweza kuongeza utendaji wa kikusanya data (poller). Data zaidi hupakiwa kwenye pakiti moja ya SNMP jambo ambalo linaweza kupunguza muda wa kuendesha ulizo la data. Hata hivyo, baadhi ya vifaa vinaweza kukataa kabisa kujibu pakiti zenye ukubwa wa juu wa marudio uliowekwa kuwa mkubwa mno. Hili linaweza kuwa kweli hasa kwa vifaa vya aina ya IoT vyenye nguvu ndogo au vifaa vidogo vya IT vilivyopachikwa. Umakini maalum kwa MTU ya njia ya mtandao kwa ujumla unapaswa pia kuzingatiwa kwani kuweka thamani iliyo juu mno kunaweza kusababisha kugawanyika kwa pakiti."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Detect on Re-Index"
msgstr "Tambua Kiotomatiki Wakati wa Kuorodhesha Upya"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Detect/Set on first Re-Index"
msgstr "Tambua/Weka Kiotomatiki Wakati wa Kuorodhesha Upya kwa Mara ya Kwanza"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Repetition"
msgstr "Marudio %d"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Repetitions"
msgstr "Marudio %d"

