#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Using Slope Mode evens out the shape of the graphs at the expense of some on screen resolution."
msgstr "Kutumia Hali ya Mteremko kunasawazisha umbo la grafu kwa kupunguza kiasi fulani ubora wa mwonekano kwenye skrini."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Scaling Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Skeli"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale"
msgstr "Skeli ya Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto scale the y-axis instead of defining an upper and lower limit. Note: if this is check both the Upper and Lower limit will be ignored."
msgstr "Pima mhimili wa y kiotomatiki badala ya kubainisha kikomo cha juu na cha chini. Kumbuka: ikiwa hii imeteuliwa, kikomo cha Juu na cha Chini vyote vitapuuzwa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Skeli ya Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use <br> --alt-autoscale to scale to the absolute minimum and maximum <br> --alt-autoscale-max to scale to the maximum value, using a given lower limit <br> --alt-autoscale-min to scale to the minimum value, using a given upper limit <br> --alt-autoscale (with limits) to scale using both lower and upper limits (RRDtool default) <br>"
msgstr "Tumia <br> --alt-autoscale kupima hadi kiwango cha chini kabisa na cha juu kabisa <br> --alt-autoscale-max kupima hadi thamani ya juu zaidi, kwa kutumia kikomo cha chini kilichotolewa <br> --alt-autoscale-min kupima hadi thamani ya chini zaidi, kwa kutumia kikomo cha juu kilichotolewa <br> --alt-autoscale (yenye vikomo) kupima kwa kutumia vikomo vyote viwili vya chini na vya juu (chaguomsingi la RRDtool) <br>"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (ignoring given limits)"
msgstr "Tumia --alt-autoscale (kwa kupuuza vikomo vilivyotolewa)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-max (accepting a lower limit)"
msgstr "Tumia --alt-autoscale-max (kwa kukubali kikomo cha chini)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-min (accepting an upper limit)"
msgstr "Tumia --alt-autoscale-min (kwa kukubali kikomo cha juu)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits, RRDtool default)"
msgstr "Tumia --alt-autoscale (kwa kukubali vikomo vyote viwili, chaguomsingi la RRDtool)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Logarithmic Scaling (--logarithmic)"
msgstr "Skeli ya Logarithmi (--logarithmic)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Tumia skeli ya logarithmi kwa mhimili wa y"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"
msgstr "Vipimo vya SI kwa Skeli ya Logarithmi (--units=si)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Tumia Vipimo vya SI kwa Skeli ya Logarithmi badala ya kutumia nukuu ya kipeo.<br> Kumbuka: Grafu za mstari hutumia nukuu ya SI kwa chaguomsingi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Rigid Boundaries Mode (--rigid)"
msgstr "Hali ya Mipaka Migumu (--rigid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Usipanue kikomo cha chini na cha juu ikiwa grafu ina thamani iliyo nje ya masafa halali."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Kikomo cha Juu (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Thamani ya juu zaidi ya wima kwa grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Kikomo cha Chini (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Thamani ya chini zaidi ya wima kwa grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Gridi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Thamani ya Gridi ya Kipimo (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Huweka thamani ya kipeo kwenye mhimili wa Y kwa nambari. Kumbuka: Chaguo hili limepitwa na wakati na limebadilishwa na chaguo la --y-grid. Katika chaguo hili, mistari ya gridi ya mhimili wa Y huonekana katika kila hatua ya muda wa gridi. Lebo huwekwa kila mistari ya kipengele cha lebo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Thamani ya Kipeo cha Kipimo (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Cacti should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Kipimo ambacho Cacti inapaswa kutumia kwenye mhimili wa Y. Tumia 3 kuonyesha kila kitu katika \"k\" au -6 kuonyesha kila kitu katika \"u\" (maikro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Urefu wa Kipimo (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "RRDtool inapaswa kuchukulia lebo za mhimili wa y kuwa na tarakimu ngapi? Huenda ukahitaji kutumia chaguo hili kutengeneza nafasi ya kutosha mara tu unapoanza kurekebisha uwekaji lebo wa mhimili wa y."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Hakuna Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Ili kuepuka athari za ukungu wa anti-aliasing, RRDtool huunganisha nukta kwenye pikseli za ubora wa kifaa, jambo ambalo hutoa mwonekano safi zaidi. Ikiwa hupendi hili, unaweza kutumia swichi hii kuzima tabia hii.<br><strong>Kumbuka: </strong>Gridfitting imezimwa kwa matokeo ya PDF, EPS, SVG kwa chaguomsingi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Gridi Mbadala ya Y (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Kanuni huhakikisha kuwa una gridi kila wakati, kwamba kuna mistari ya gridi ya kutosha lakini si mingi mno, na kwamba gridi ni ya kipimo cha metriki. Kigezo hiki pia kitahakikisha unapata desimali za kutosha zinazoonyeshwa hata kama grafu yako inaenda kutoka 69.998 hadi 70.001.<br><strong>Kumbuka: </strong>Kigezo hiki kinaweza kuingilia kati chaguo za --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Mhimili"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Mhimili wa Kulia (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "Mhimili wa pili utachorwa upande wa kulia wa grafu. Umeunganishwa na mhimili wa kushoto kupitia vigezo vya skeli na mabadiliko."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Lebo ya Mhimili wa Kulia (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Lebo ya mhimili wa kulia."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Angle (--right-axis-label-angle)"
msgstr "Pembe ya Lebo ya Mhimili wa Kulia (--right-axis-label-angle)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right label rotation in degrees counter clockwise. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank follows the vertical label angle. Angles other than 90 and 270 may overlap nearby content."
msgstr "Mzunguko wa lebo ya kulia katika nyuzi kinyume cha saa. Inahitaji RRDtool 1.11 au mpya zaidi. Kuacha wazi kunafuata pembe ya lebo wima. Pembe zingine mbali na 90 na 270 zinaweza kuingiliana na maudhui yaliyo karibu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Range (--right-axis-range)"
msgstr "Masafa ya Lebo ya Mhimili wa Kulia (--right-axis-range)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Only show right axis labels within min:max, for example 0:100. Either bound may be blank. This does not change the axis scale. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank leaves labels unrestricted."
msgstr "Onyesha tu lebo za mhimili wa kulia ndani ya min:max, kwa mfano 0:100. Mpaka wowote unaweza kuwa wazi. Hii haibadilishi skeli ya mhimili. Inahitaji RRDtool 1.11 au mpya zaidi. Kuacha wazi kunaacha lebo bila vizuizi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Umbizo la Mhimili wa Kulia (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Kwa chaguomsingi, umbizo la lebo za mhimili huamuliwa kiotomatiki.  Ikiwa unataka kufanya hivi mwenyewe, tumia chaguo hili ukitumia hoja zilezile za %lf unazozijua kutoka kwa amri za PRINT na GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Kipangiliaji cha Mhimili wa Kulia (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Unapoweka lebo za mhimili wa kulia, tumia kanuni kwa umbizo la data.  Maumbizo yanayotumika ni pamoja na \"numeric\" ambapo data huchukuliwa kama nambari, \"timestamp\" ambapo thamani hutafsiriwa kama mihuri ya muda ya UNIX (idadi ya sekunde tangu Januari 1970) na kuonyeshwa kwa kutumia umbizo la strftime (chaguomsingi ni \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Tazama pia --units-length na --right-axis-format.  Mwisho, \"duration\" ambapo thamani hutafsiriwa kama muda kwa milisekunde.  Umbizaji unafuata kanuni za PRINT/GPRINT zenye sifa ya valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Format (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Umbizo la Mhimili wa Kushoto (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Kipangiliaji cha Mhimili wa Kushoto (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Unapoweka lebo za mhimili wa kushoto, tumia kanuni kwa umbizo la data.  Maumbizo yanayotumika ni pamoja na \"numeric\" ambapo data huchukuliwa kama nambari, \"timestamp\" ambapo thamani hutafsiriwa kama mihuri ya muda ya UNIX (idadi ya sekunde tangu Januari 1970) na kuonyeshwa kwa kutumia umbizo la strftime (chaguomsingi ni \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Tazama pia --units-length.  Mwisho, \"duration\" ambapo thamani hutafsiriwa kama muda kwa milisekunde.  Umbizaji unafuata kanuni za PRINT/GPRINT zenye sifa ya valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Kielelezo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Ujazaji Nafasi Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Jaza nafasi kwenye maandishi ili kielelezo na data ya grafu vilingane kila wakati. Kumbuka: hii inaweza kusababisha grafu kuchukua muda mrefu zaidi kuchorwa kwa sababu ya mzigo mkubwa zaidi. Pia Ujazaji Nafasi Kiotomatiki huenda usiwe sahihi kwenye aina zote za grafu, kuweka lebo kwa uthabiti kwa kawaida husaidia."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Lebo Zinazobadilika (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Chora viashiria vya mstari kama mstari."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Lazimisha Kielelezo cha Kanuni (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Lazimisha uundaji wa vielelezo vya HRULE na VRULE."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Upana wa Tabo (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Kwa chaguomsingi upana wa tabo ni pikseli 40, tumia chaguo hili kuubadilisha."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Nafasi ya Kielelezo (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Weka kielelezo upande uliotolewa wa grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
msgstr "Mwelekeo wa Kielelezo (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend items in the given vertical order."
msgstr "Weka vipengee vya kielelezo katika mpangilio wima uliotolewa."

#: include/global_form.php lib/api_aggregate.php
msgid "Graph Item Type"
msgstr "Aina ya Kipengee cha Grafu"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented visually on the graph."
msgstr "Jinsi data ya kipengee hiki inavyowakilishwa kwa mwonekano kwenye grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The data source to use for this graph item."
msgstr "Chanzo cha data cha kutumia kwa kipengee hiki cha grafu."

#: include/global_form.php lib/html.php
msgid "Primary Color"
msgstr "Rangi Kuu"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The color to use for the canvas item and legend."
msgstr "Rangi ya kutumia kwa kipengee cha turubai na kielelezo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Primary Opacity"
msgstr "Uwazi wa Rangi Kuu"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity of the primary color."
msgstr "Kiwango cha uwazi wa rangi kuu."

#: include/global_form.php lib/html.php
msgid "Gradient Color"
msgstr "Rangi ya Mpito"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The gradient color to use for the canvas item."
msgstr "Rangi ya mpito ya kutumia kwa kipengee cha turubai."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Gradient Opacity"
msgstr "Uwazi wa Rangi ya Mpito"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity of the gradient color."
msgstr "Kiwango cha uwazi wa rangi ya mpito."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Gradient Height"
msgstr "Kimo cha Mpito wa Rangi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Gradient Height parameter can create three different behaviors. If it is > 0, then the gradient is a fixed height, starting at the line going down. If it is < 0, then the gradient starts at a fixed height above the x-axis, going down to the x-axis. If it is == 0, then the gradient goes from the top of the area fill to x-axis."
msgstr "Kigezo cha Kimo cha Mpito wa Rangi kinaweza kuunda tabia tatu tofauti. Ikiwa ni > 0, basi mpito una kimo kisichobadilika, ukianzia kwenye mstari kwenda chini. Ikiwa ni < 0, basi mpito huanza katika kimo kisichobadilika juu ya mhimili wa x, ukishuka hadi mhimili wa x. Ikiwa ni == 0, basi mpito huenda kutoka juu ya eneo lililojazwa hadi mhimili wa x."

#: include/global_form.php lib/rrd.php
msgid "Consolidation Function"
msgstr "Kazi ya Uunganishaji"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented statistically on the graph."
msgstr "Jinsi data ya kipengee hiki inavyowakilishwa kitakwimu kwenye grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "CDEF Function"
msgstr "Kazi ya CDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A CDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph or legend."
msgstr "Kazi ya CDEF (hisabati) ya kutumia kwa kipengee hiki kwenye grafu au kielelezo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "VDEF Function"
msgstr "Kazi ya VDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A VDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph legend."
msgstr "Kazi ya VDEF (hisabati) ya kutumia kwa kipengee hiki kwenye kielelezo cha grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Shift Data"
msgstr "Sogeza Data"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Offset your data on the time axis (x-axis) by the amount specified in the 'value' field."
msgstr "Sogeza data yako kwenye mhimili wa muda (mhimili wa x) kwa kiasi kilichobainishwa katika sehemu ya 'value'."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "[HRULE|VRULE]: The value of the graph item.<br/> [TICK]: The fraction for the tick line.<br/> [SHIFT]: The time offset in seconds."
msgstr "[HRULE|VRULE]: Thamani ya kipengee cha grafu.<br/> [TICK]: Sehemu ya mstari wa alama.<br/> [SHIFT]: Mabadiliko ya muda kwa sekunde."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Type"
msgstr "Aina ya GPRINT"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "If this graph item is a GPRINT, you can optionally choose another format here. You can define additional types under \"GPRINT Presets\"."
msgstr "Ikiwa kipengee hiki cha grafu ni GPRINT, unaweza kuchagua umbizo lingine hapa kwa hiari. Unaweza kufafanua aina za ziada chini ya \"Mipangilio Awali ya GPRINT\"."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Alignment (TEXTALIGN)"
msgstr "Upangaji wa Maandishi (TEXTALIGN)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "All subsequent legend line(s) will be aligned as given here.  You may use this command multiple times in a single graph.  This command does not produce tabular layout.<br/><strong>Note: </strong>You may want to insert a &lt;HR&gt; on the preceding graph item.<br/> <strong>Note: </strong>A &lt;HR&gt; on this legend line will obsolete this setting!"
msgstr "Mistari yote inayofuata ya kielelezo itapangwa kama ilivyotolewa hapa.  Unaweza kutumia amri hii mara nyingi katika grafu moja.  Amri hii haitoi mpangilio wa jedwali.<br/><strong>Kumbuka: </strong>Huenda ukataka kuingiza &lt;HR&gt; kwenye kipengee kilichotangulia cha grafu.<br/> <strong>Kumbuka: </strong>&lt;HR&gt; kwenye mstari huu wa kielelezo itabatilisha mpangilio huu!"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Format"
msgstr "Umbizo la Maandishi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text that will be displayed on the legend for this graph item."
msgstr "Maandishi yatakayoonyeshwa kwenye kielelezo kwa kipengee hiki cha grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend for Export/Hover"
msgstr "Kielelezo cha Kuhamisha/Kuelea Juu"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A Legend to be displayed when Hovering over the Graph and also used for Graph Export.  Hover requires RRDtool 1.9.1 and above.  It may work for RRDtool 1.8+, but not for Thold Legends."
msgstr "Kielelezo kitakachoonyeshwa unapoweka kielekezi juu ya Grafu na pia hutumika kwa Uhamishaji wa Grafu.  Kuelea juu kunahitaji RRDtool 1.9.1 na kuendelea.  Huenda ikafanya kazi kwa RRDtool 1.8+, lakini si kwa Vielelezo vya Thold."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Insert Hard Return"
msgstr "Ingiza Mstari Mpya wa Lazima"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Forces the legend to the next line after this item."
msgstr "Hulazimisha kielelezo kwenda kwenye mstari unaofuata baada ya kipengee hiki."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Line Width (decimal)"
msgstr "Unene wa Mstari (desimali)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In case LINE was chosen, specify width of line here.  You must include a decimal precision, for example 2.00"
msgstr "Iwapo LINE ilichaguliwa, bainisha upana wa mstari hapa.  Ni lazima ujumuishe usahihi wa desimali, kwa mfano 2.00"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dashes (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"
msgstr "Mikato ya mistari (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dashes modifier enables dashed line style."
msgstr "Kirekebishi cha dashes huwezesha mtindo wa mstari wa mikato."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dash Offset (dash-offset=offset)"
msgstr "Usogezo wa Mkato (dash-offset=offset)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dash-offset parameter specifies an offset into the pattern at which the stroke begins."
msgstr "Kigezo cha dash-offset hubainisha usogezo ndani ya muundo ambapo mstari huanza."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name given to this graph template."
msgstr "Jina lililopewa kiolezo hiki cha grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Class of this Graph Template."
msgstr "Daraja la Kiolezo hiki cha Grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Version given to this Graph Template."
msgstr "Toleo lililopewa Kiolezo hiki cha Grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Multiple Instances"
msgstr "Matukio Mengi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if there can be more than one Graph of this type per Device."
msgstr "Tiki kisanduku hiki ikiwa kunaweza kuwa na zaidi ya Grafu moja ya aina hii kwa kila Kifaa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Test Data Sources"
msgstr "Jaribu Vyanzo vya Data"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Tiki kisanduku hiki ikiwa unataka kujaribu Vyanzo vya Data kabla ya kuviunda.  Jaribu Vyanzo vya Data ikiwa imewezeshwa, ikiwa Chanzo cha Data hakirejeshi data halali, Grafu haitaundwa.  Mpangilio huu ni muhimu ikiwa unataka kuwa na Kiolezo cha Kifaa cha jumla zaidi kinachoweza kujumuisha Violezo vingi vya Grafu vinavyoweza kutumika kwa kuchagua kulingana na sifa za Kifaa chenyewe.  Kumbuka: Ikiwa una hati inayochukua muda mrefu kuendeshwa kama Chanzo cha Data, muda wa kuunda Grafu utaongezeka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a name for this graph item input, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Ingiza jina la ingizo hili la kipengee cha grafu, hakikisha ni kitu unachokitambua."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a description for this graph item input to describe what this input is used for."
