msgid "How will Cacti handle event logging."
msgstr "Jinsi Cacti itashughulikia uwekaji kumbukumbu za matukio."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Actions"
msgstr "Vitendo vya Kumbukumbu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What Log Actions do you wish to provide to the Cacti Administrator.  You can grant either purge, rotate, or both purge and rotate.  Base files can be both purged and rotated, and already rotated files can only be purged if you grant that permission."
msgstr "Ni Vitendo vipi vya Kumbukumbu unavyotaka kumpa Msimamizi wa Cacti. Unaweza kuruhusu kusafisha kabisa, kuzungusha, au vyote kusafisha kabisa na kuzungusha. Faili za msingi zinaweza kusafishwa kabisa na kuzungushwa, na faili ambazo tayari zimezungushwa zinaweza kusafishwa kabisa tu ukitoa ruhusa hiyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Generic Log Level"
msgstr "Kiwango cha Jumla cha Kumbukumbu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file.  WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Unataka kiwango gani cha maelezo kitumwe kwenye faili ya kumbukumbu. ONYO: Kuiacha katika hali nyingine yoyote isipokuwa NONE au LOW kunaweza kumaliza nafasi yako ya diski haraka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expand log details"
msgstr "Panua maelezo ya kumbukumbu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of expansion do you want on the log file? Increase expansion can slow search results"
msgstr "Unataka kiwango gani cha upanuzi kwenye faili ya kumbukumbu? Kuongeza upanuzi kunaweza kupunguza kasi ya matokeo ya utafutaji"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Input Validation Issues"
msgstr "Rekodi Masuala ya Uthibitishaji wa Ingizo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Record when request fields are accessed without going through proper input validation"
msgstr "Rekodi wakati sehemu za ombi zinapofikiwa bila kupitia uthibitishaji sahihi wa ingizo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Tracing"
msgstr "Ufuatiliaji wa Chanzo cha Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "A developer only option to trace the creation of Data Sources mainly around checks for uniqueness"
msgstr "Chaguo la msanidi programu pekee la kufuatilia uundaji wa Vyanzo vya Data hasa kuhusu ukaguzi wa upekee"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Ignored General Errors"
