msgstr "Usaidizi wa Gradianti Umewezeshwa kwa chati za AREA na STACK."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Mbinu ya Ruhusa za Grafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Kuna mbinu nne za kubaini Ruhusa za Grafu za Mtumiaji. Ya kwanza ni 'Ya Kuruhusu'. Chini ya mpangilio wa 'Ya Kuruhusu', Mtumiaji anahitaji tu idhini ya kufikia Grafu, Kifaa au Kiolezo cha Grafu ili kupata idhini ya kufikia Grafu zinazotumika kwake. Chini ya 'Ya Kubana', Mtumiaji lazima awe na idhini ya kufikia Grafu, Kifaa, na Kiolezo cha Grafu ili kupata idhini ya kufikia Grafu. Mbinu hizi mbili za kwanza zina matatizo ya kupanuka kwa usakinishaji mkubwa sana. Kwa hivyo, chaguo mbili za ziada zinapatikana. Hizo ni 'Kulingana na Kifaa', ambayo inamaanisha kuwa ukipata idhini ya kufikia Kifaa, unapata idhini ya kufikia Grafu zake. Na mwisho 'Kulingana na Kiolezo cha Grafu', ambayo inamaanisha kuwa ukipata idhini ya kufikia 'Kiolezo cha Grafu' unapata idhini ya kufikia Grafu zote za Kifaa za Kiolezo hicho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Ya Kuruhusu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Ya Kubana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Kulingana na Kifaa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Mbinu ya Kuunda Grafu/Chanzo cha Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Ikiwekwa kuwa Rahisi, Grafu na Vyanzo vya Data vinaweza kuundwa tu kutoka kwa Grafu Mpya. Ikiwa ni Ya Kina, uundaji wa zamani wa Grafu na Vyanzo vya Data unatumika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Rahisi"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Ya Kina"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Onyesha Usaidizi wa Fomu/Mipangilio Ndani kwa Ndani"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Ikichaguliwa, Usaidizi wa Fomu na Mipangilio utaonyeshwa ndani kwa ndani. Vinginevyo, utaonyeshwa unapoelea juu ya kitufe cha usaidizi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Usaidizi wa Ukurasa wa Ndani Pekee"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Kwa chaguo-msingi usaidizi wa ukurasa wa Cacti upo katika docs.cacti.net. Hata hivyo, ikiwa mfumo wako hauna muunganisho wa Intaneti, unaweza kupakua nyaraka ndani ya mfumo katika umbizo la HTML na kuzihifadhi katika eneo la 'docs' la seva yako ya Cacti. Ukichagua kutumia tu eneo la ndani kwa nyaraka za usaidizi wa ukurasa, chagua kisanduku hiki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Uthibitishaji wa Ufutaji"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Mwulize mtumiaji kabla ya kufuta kipengee."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Mpangilio wa Awali wa Kuhifadhi Chanzo cha Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Ikiwashwa, Cacti itaweka Kitufe cha Redio ili Kufuta Vyanzo vya Data vinavyohusiana na Grafu wakati wa kuondoa Grafu. Kumbuka: Cacti haitaruhusu kuondolewa kwa Vyanzo vya Data ikiwa vinatumika katika Grafu zingine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Kufungua Grafu Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Ikiwashwa, Cacti haitafunga Grafu. Hii inaruhusu urekebishaji wa haraka kwa mkono wa Vyanzo vya Data vinavyohusiana na Grafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Ficha Dashibodi ya Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Kwa matumizi na Usaidizi wa Viungo vya Nje vya Cacti. Kwa kutumia mpangilio huu, unaweza kuficha Dashibodi ya Cacti, ili uweze kuonyesha ukurasa wako mwenyewe pekee."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Washa Kuburuta-na-Kudondosha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Baadhi ya violesura vya Cacti vinaunga mkono Kuburuta-na-Kudondosha. Ikichaguliwa, chaguo hili litawashwa. Kumbuka: Kwa mtumiaji mwenye ulemavu wa kuona, chaguo hili linaweza kuzimwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "GitHub/GitLab API Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya API ya GitHub/GitLab"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Base API Repository URL"
msgstr "URL ya Msingi ya Hazina ya API"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub or GitLab enter the GitHub or GitLab API url here.  The default is https://api.github.com/.  Change this only if you have your own repository that you maintain for Cacti Plugins."
