#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Ikichaguliwa, majaribio yoyote ya kufikia Cacti yataelekezwa kwa HTTPS ili kuhakikisha usalama wa hali ya juu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Inline JavaScript Protection"
msgstr "Ulinzi wa JavaScript ya Ndani kwa Ndani"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls how the Content-Security-Policy restricts inline JavaScript.  HTMX keeps the 'unsafe-inline' policy that all current themes and plugins rely on and matches the behaviour of prior releases.  Nonce Migration emits a strict nonce policy in report-only mode so incompatible core and plugin scripts can be identified without breaking the UI.  Nonce Enforcement blocks scripts without the request nonce and requires CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE to be true in include/config.php; without that explicit gate it safely remains in report-only mode.  None also permits unsafe eval() calls and is the least restrictive option."
msgstr "Inadhibiti jinsi Content-Security-Policy inavyoweka vikwazo kwa JavaScript ya ndani ya mstari (inline). HTMX huhifadhi sera ya 'unsafe-inline' ambayo mandhari na programu-jalizi zote za sasa zinategemea na inalingana na utendaji wa matoleo ya awali. Uhamishaji wa Nonce (Nonce Migration) hutoa sera kali ya nonce katika hali ya ripoti pekee ili hati za msingi na za programu-jalizi zisizooana ziweze kutambuliwa bila kuharibu kiolesura (UI). Utekelezaji wa Nonce (Nonce Enforcement) huzuia hati zisizo na nonce ya ombi na huhitaji CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE iwe true katika include/config.php; bila kizuizi hicho dhahiri hubaki salama katika hali ya ripoti pekee. Hakuna (None) pia huruhusu miito ya eval() isiyo salama na ndilo chaguo lenye vikwazo vichache zaidi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "HTMX (Default)"
msgstr "HTMX (Chaguo-msingi)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Migration (Report Only)"
msgstr "Uhamishaji wa Nonce (Ripoti Pekee)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Enforcement (Advanced)"
msgstr "Utekelezaji wa Nonce (Ya Juu)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI ya Ripoti ya Ukiukaji wa CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Used in Nonce Migration and Nonce Enforcement modes.  URL where browsers post Content-Security-Policy violation reports.  Leave blank to use the bundled csp_report.php handler under the configured Cacti URL path."
msgstr "Hutumika katika hali za Uhamishaji wa Nonce na Utekelezaji wa Nonce. URL ambapo vivinjari hutuma ripoti za ukiukaji wa Content-Security-Policy. Acha wazi ili kutumia kishughulikiaji cha csp_report.php kilichojumuishwa chini ya njia ya URL ya Cacti iliyosanidiwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Vyanzo Mbadala vya Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space-delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Majina ya vikoa yaliyotenganishwa kwa nafasi ambayo yataruhusiwa kufikiwa nje ya Seva ya Wavuti yenyewe. Hii ni muhimu kwa watumiaji wanaochagua kutumia CDN, au tovuti ya kupangisha (hosting). Vyanzo vinaweza kujumuisha alama za jumla (wildcards) kwa mfano: *.mydomain.com, au itifaki, kwa mfano: https://*.example.com. Vyanzo hivi Mbadala vinajumuisha aina za Picha, CSS na JavaScript pekee."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable htmx for in-place filter updates"
msgstr "Wezesha htmx kwa masasisho ya vichujio papo hapo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, the htmx loader is included so pages that opt in can refresh their filter results without a full page reload. Disable only if plugins misbehave."
msgstr "Inapowezeshwa, kipakiaji cha htmx hujumuishwa ili kurasa zinazochagua kutumia ziweze kusasisha matokeo ya vichujio vyake bila kupakia upya ukurasa mzima. Zima tu ikiwa programu-jalizi zinafanya kazi vibaya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On (default)"
msgstr "Imewashwa (chaguo-msingi)"

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Imezimwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent"
msgstr "Wakala wa Mbali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using multiple Data Collectors, there are the Settings for Communicating between Data Collectors"
msgstr "Unapotumia Wakusanyaji Data wengi, kuna Mipangilio ya Mawasiliano kati ya Wakusanyaji Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Lango la TCP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The TCP Port used for communicating with the Remote Data Collectors.  The protocol will match the Central Cacti web server (either HTTP or HTTPS).  Leave blank to use the default ports."
msgstr "Lango la TCP linalotumika kuwasiliana na Wakusanyaji Data wa Mbali. Itifaki italingana na seva kuu ya wavuti ya Cacti (ama HTTP au HTTPS). Acha wazi ili kutumia malango chaguo-msingi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Muda, kwa sekunde, ambao seva kuu ya wavuti ya Cacti itasubiri majibu kutoka kwa Mkusanyaji Data wa Mbali ili kupata maelezo mbalimbali ya Kifaa kabla ya kuacha ombi. Kwenye Vifaa ambavyo vimehusishwa na Wakusanyaji Data wengine mbali na Mkusanyaji Data Mkuu wa Cacti, Wakala wa Mbali lazima atumike kukusanya maelezo ya Kifaa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Verify Remote Agent TLS Certificates"
msgstr "Thibitisha Vyeti vya TLS vya Wakala wa Mbali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require a trusted certificate whose name matches the Remote Data Collector hostname. Disable only while replacing legacy self-signed certificates."
msgstr "Hitaji cheti kinachoaminika ambacho jina lake linalingana na jina la mwenyeji (hostname) la Mkusanyaji Data wa Mbali. Zima tu unapobadilisha vyeti vya zamani vilivyotiwa saini binafsi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "No (Legacy Self-signed Certificate)"
msgstr "Hapana (Cheti cha Zamani Kilichotiwa Saini Binafsi)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent CA File"
msgstr "Faili ya CA ya Wakala wa Mbali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to a PEM CA bundle used to verify Remote Data Collector certificates. Leave blank to use the PHP/OpenSSL system trust store."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya hiari kuelekea kifurushi cha PEM CA kinachotumika kuthibitisha vyeti vya Mkusanyaji Data wa Mbali. Acha wazi ili kutumia hifadhi ya uaminifu ya mfumo wa PHP/OpenSSL."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Logging Level"
msgstr "Kiwango cha Kuweka Kumbukumbu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Logging level for Automation activities.  Levels are Low, Medium and High."
msgstr "Kiwango cha Kuweka Kumbukumbu kwa shughuli za Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki. Viwango ni Chini, Wastani na Juu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Serial Automation Scans"
msgstr "Lazimisha Uchanganuzi wa Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki kwa Mfuatano"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti Automation will scan one network at a time not in Parallel.  This setting can be useful when your Cacti Web Servers have limited cores for performing Automation checks."
msgstr "Inapowezeshwa, Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki wa Cacti utachanganua mtandao mmoja kwa wakati mmoja na si Sambamba. Mpangilio huu unaweza kuwa muhimu wakati Seva zako za Wavuti za Cacti zina viini (cores) vichache vya kufanya ukaguzi wa Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Wezesha Uundaji wa Grafu Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Inapozimwa, Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki wa Cacti hautaunda Grafu yoyote moja kwa moja. Hii ni muhimu unapobadilisha mipangilio ya Kifaa ili kuepuka kuunda Grafu mpya kila wakati unapohifadhi kipengee. Kuita Kanuni za Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki kwa mkono bado kutawezekana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Wezesha Uundaji wa Kipengee cha Mti Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Inapozimwa, Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki wa Cacti hautaunda Kipengee chochote cha Mti moja kwa moja. Hii ni muhimu unapobadilisha mipangilio ya Kifaa au Grafu ili kuepuka kuunda Maingizo mapya ya Mti kila wakati unapohifadhi kipengee. Kuita Kanuni kwa mkono bado kutawezekana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Barua Pepe ya Mpokeaji wa Arifa za Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Anwani ya Barua Pepe ya kutumia Barua Pepe za Arifa za Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki ikiwa haijabainishwa katika kiwango cha Mtandao wa Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki. Ikiwa sehemu hii, au thamani ya Mtandao wa Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki imeachwa wazi, Cacti itatumia akaunti Kuu ya Barua Pepe ya Wasimamizi wa Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Jina la Mtumaji wa Arifa za Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Jina la Barua Pepe la kutumia kwa Barua Pepe za Arifa za Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki ikiwa halijabainishwa katika kiwango cha Mtandao wa Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki. Ikiwa sehemu hii, au thamani ya Mtandao wa Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki imeachwa wazi, Cacti itatumia Jina la Mtumaji chaguo-msingi la mfumo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Barua Pepe ya Mtumaji wa Arifa za Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Anwani ya Barua Pepe ya kutumia kwa Barua Pepe za Arifa za Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki ikiwa haijabainishwa katika kiwango cha Mtandao wa Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki.  Ikiwa sehemu hii, au thamani ya Mtandao wa Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki itaachwa wazi, Cacti itatumia Anwani ya Barua Pepe ya Kutoka chaguomsingi ya mfumo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Chaguomsingi za Kiolezo cha Grafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Jaribio la Chanzo cha Data cha Kiolezo cha Grafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Tiki kisanduku hiki ikiwa ungependa kujaribu Vyanzo vya Data kabla ya kuundwa kwake kwa Violezo vya Grafu vipya na vilivyoingizwa hivi karibuni.  Wakati Jaribio la Vyanzo vya Data limewashwa, ikiwa Chanzo cha Data hakirejeshi data halali, Grafu haitaundwa.  Mpangilio huu ni muhimu ikiwa ungependa kuwa na Kiolezo cha Kifaa cha jumla zaidi kinachoweza kujumuisha Violezo vya Grafu vingi ambavyo vinaweza kutumika kwa kuchagua kulingana na sifa za Kifaa chenyewe.  Kumbuka: Ikiwa una hati inayochukua muda mrefu kuendesha kama Chanzo cha Data, muda wa kuunda Grafu utaongezeka."

