#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Washa MD5 na DES kwa SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Algoriti za uthibitishaji wa MD5 na faragha ya DES ni za zamani, dhaifu, na hazipatikani kwenye matoleo yaliyoimarishwa (FIPS) ya PHP na Net-SNMP.  Zikizimwa, MD5 na DES huondolewa kwenye orodha kunjuzi za Itifaki ya Uthibitishaji na Faragha ya SNMPv3 zinazoonyeshwa unapohariri Kifaa na katika Chaguo za SNMP za Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki, zikiacha algoriti imara zaidi za SHA na AES pekee."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Washa Akiba ya Vitambulisho"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Imarisha awali na uhifadhi kwenye akiba hoja za vitambulisho vya SNMPv3 mara moja kwa kila badiliko la vitambulisho ili kila mchakato wa kikusanyaji uzitumie tena badala ya kuzijenga upya kwa kila ombi.  Hii huleta uokoaji mdogo wakati wa kukusanya data kwa vitambulisho vya SNMPv3 kupitia faili tumizi za Net-SNMP.  Kiendelezi cha php-snmp hushughulikia maombi mengi ya get ya SNMPv3 ndani ya mchakato na kupita akiba hii, lakini faili tumizi za Net-SNMP (na kwa hivyo akiba hii) bado zinatumika kwa SNMP walks, matokeo ya heksadesimali, maombi yanayoweka muktadha au kitambulisho cha injini, na mchanganyiko wa itifaki ambao toleo la PHP linaloendesha haliungi mkono.  Washa hii ikiwa unakusanya mzigo wowote wa kazi kati ya hizo kwa vitambulisho vya SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max OID Limit"
msgstr "Kikomo cha Juu cha OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Idadi chaguomsingi ya juu zaidi ya OID za SNMP Get za kutuma kwa kila ombi la snmpget.  Kwa Vifaa, mpangilio huu hudhibitiwa katika kiwango cha Kifaa.  Unapaswa kutumia mpangilio huu tu unapotumia API ya SNMP ya Cacti moja kwa moja katika hati au programu-jalizi zako."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Ukubwa wa Uletaji wa Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Ni OID ngapi zinapaswa kurejeshwa kwa kila ombi la snmpbulkwalk? Kwa Vifaa vilivyo na miti mikubwa ya SNMP, kuongeza ukubwa huu kutaongeza utendaji wa kuweka faharasa upya kupitia WAN."

