msgstr "Kipindi cha ukusanyaji wa data kinachotumika.  Mpangilio huu utaathiri ni mara ngapi RRDfiles zinakaguliwa na kusasishwa.  <strong><u>KUMBUKA: Ukibadilisha thamani hii, ni lazima ujaze tena kache ya poller.  Kushindwa kufanya hivyo kunaweza kusababisha upotezaji wa data.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "is not a valid choice."
msgstr "si chaguo halali."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Kipindi cha Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Marudio ambayo mkusanyaji wa data wa Cacti ataanzishwa.  Unaweza kutumia crontab, kazi iliyopangwa (kwa Windows), au huduma ya cactid systemd kudhibiti uanzishaji wa mkusanyaji wa data wa Cacti.  Kwa maelekezo ya kutumia daemon ya cactid, kagua faili ya README.md katika saraka ya service."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Sawazisha Mzigo wa Michakato"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Ukichagua chaguo hili, Cacti itajaribu kusawazisha mzigo wa kila mchakato wa poller kwa kugawa vipengee vya poller kwa usawa kwa kila mchakato."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Upana wa Towe la Utatuzi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Ukichagua chaguo hili, Cacti itakagua towe linalozidi uwezo wa Cacti kulihifadhi na kutoa onyo inapolipata."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa Mwisho wa Ajenti wa Mbali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Onyesha Upya Jedwali la Poller Kila Mzunguko"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Mpangilio huu ni wa mifumo ya poller moja pekee ili kujenga upya jedwali la towe la poller kwenye kila mzunguko wa ukusanyaji wa data ili kuzuia jedwali la kumbukumbu kubadilishana (swapping) kwenye mifumo mikubwa sana yenye hifadhidata kubwa zinazoweza kutumia swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Replication"
msgstr "Uigaji wa Mkusanyaji wa Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Kipindi cha Usawazishaji wa Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Kipindi chaguomsingi cha usawazishaji wa ukusanyaji wa data cha kutumia unapounda poller.  Mpangilio huu utaathiri ni mara ngapi poller za mbali zinakaguliwa na kusasishwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Zima Uigaji wa Kache ya Rasilimali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Kwa chaguo-msingi, Kikusanya Data kikuu cha Cacti kitahifadhi tovuti nzima na programu-jalizi kwenye Hifadhi ya Rasilimali (Resource Cache). Kisha, mara kwa mara Vikusanya Data vya Mbali vitajisasisha kwa masasisho yoyote kutoka kwa Kikusanya Data kikuu cha Cacti. Hifadhi hii ya Rasilimali kimsingi huwezesha Vikusanya Data vya Mbali kujiboresha vyenyewe. Iwapo hutaki kutumia chaguo hili, unaweza kulizima kwa kutumia mpangilio huu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Automatic Full Sync on Upgrade"
msgstr "Zima Usawazishaji Kamili wa Kiotomatiki Wakati wa Kuboresha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, upon upgrading the Main Cacti system, it will perform a Full Sync to all Data Collectors.  This process may be time consuming.  Therefore, to allow upgrades to be completed quicker, we provide this option.  Note that if this is disabled, the Cacti administrator must force this process from the Data Collectors interface after upgrade."
msgstr "Kwa chaguo-msingi, mfumo Mkuu wa Cacti unapoboreshwa, utafanya Usawazishaji Kamili kwa Vikusanya Data vyote. Mchakato huu unaweza kuchukua muda mrefu. Kwa hivyo, ili kuwezesha uboreshaji kukamilika haraka zaidi, tunatoa chaguo hili. Kumbuka kuwa ikiwa hili limezimwa, msimamizi wa Cacti lazima alazimishe mchakato huu kutoka kwa kiolesura cha Vikusanya Data baada ya kuboresha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Ziada ya Kikusanya Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Uwekaji Kumbukumbu wa Data Batili"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Je, ungependa hitilafu za matokeo ya Kikusanya Data ziwekweje kwenye kumbukumbu? Chaguo ni pamoja na: 'Kwa Kina' ambacho hutoa maelezo ya kila hitilafu, 'Muhtasari' ambacho hutoa idadi ya hitilafu za matokeo kwa kila Kifaa, na 'Hakuna', ambacho hakitoi hesabu za hitilafu."

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Muhtasari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Kwa Kina"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Idadi ya Seva za Hati za PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Idadi ya michakato ya seva ya hati inayofanya kazi kwa pamoja kwa kila mchakato wa spine. Mipangilio kati ya 1 na 15 inakubaliwa. Kigezo hiki kitasaidia ikiwa unaendesha nyuzi nyingi na hati za seva ya hati na ni halali kwa Kikusanya Data cha spine pekee."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Thamani ya Muda wa Mwisho wa Hati na Seva ya Hati"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and valid for both cmd.php and spine Data Collectors."
msgstr "Muda wa juu zaidi ambao spine itasubiri hati ikamilike. Thamani hii ya muda wa mwisho iko katika sekunde na ni halali kwa Vikusanya Data vya cmd.php na spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Output Not Empty Debouncing"
msgstr "Udhibiti wa Marudio ya Onyo la Matokeo ya Poller Yasiyo Matupu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you are having issues with some data sources, your Email could be flooded with 'Poller Output Not Empty' warnings.  If this is happening, you can debounce the setting based upon this interval."
msgstr "Ikiwa una matatizo na baadhi ya vyanzo vya data, Barua pepe yako inaweza kujaa maonyo ya 'Poller Output Not Empty'. Ikiwa hili linatokea, unaweza kupunguza marudio ya mpangilio huu kulingana na kipindi hiki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Uwekaji Faharasa Upya wa Vifaa Vyote wa Mara kwa Mara"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Ratiba ya Kuweka Faharasa Upya Vifaa Vyote"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Ni kwa marudio gani ungependa kuweka faharasa upya Vifaa vyote. Uwekaji faharasa upya huu utafanyika saa sita usiku kwa marudio utakayochagua."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Kila Wiki siku ya Jumapili"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunday"
msgstr "Kila Mwezi siku ya Jumapili"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Runtime Variation/Deviance Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Mabadiliko/Mkengeuko wa Muda wa Kuendesha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "One Hour Count Warning Threshold"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha Onyo la Idadi ya Saa Moja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When the Poller Guarded Ratio (below) is reached breached more than this many times in an hour, a warning will be written to the Cacti log and an Email will be sent to the Primary Cact Administraror notifying them of the Poller runtime deviation."
msgstr "Wakati Uwiano Uliohakikishwa wa Poller (hapa chini) unapovukwa zaidi ya mara hizi katika saa moja, onyo litaandikwa kwenye kumbukumbu ya Cacti na Barua pepe itatumwa kwa Msimamizi Mkuu wa Cacti kumjulisha kuhusu mkengeuko wa muda wa kuendesha Poller."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Poller Cycle"
msgstr "Mzunguko %d wa Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Poller Cycles"
msgstr "Mizunguko %d ya Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "One Hour Guarded Poller Ratio average/max Runtime"
msgstr "Muda wa Kuendesha wa Wastani/Juu wa Uwiano Uliohakikishwa wa Poller kwa Saa Moja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Define a Guarded Poller Ratio average/max runtime (in percent).  Cacti will track breaches in these statistics and issue warnings to the Primary Cacti Administrator via Email when they happen."
msgstr "Bainisha muda wa kuendesha wa wastani/juu wa Uwiano Uliohakikishwa wa Poller (kwa asilimia). Cacti itafuatilia ukiukaji katika takwimu hizi na kutoa maonyo kwa Msimamizi Mkuu wa Cacti kupitia Barua pepe yanapotokea."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Percent"
msgstr "Asilimia %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "24 Hour Guarded Poller Ratio average/max Runtime"
msgstr "Muda wa Kuendesha wa Wastani/Juu wa Uwiano Uliohakikishwa wa Poller kwa Saa 24"

#: include/global_settings.php
