msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Muda wa juu zaidi ambao hati ya Amri za Mandharinyuma ya Cacti inaweza kuendeshwa bila kutoa hitilafu ya muda kuisha na kusitishwa. Hati hii itatekeleza kazi kama vile kuweka faharasa upya ya Vifaa na kuondoa vifaa kutoka kwa Vikusanya Data vya Mbali."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Michakato ya Pamoja ya Amri za Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Idadi ya michakato ya pamoja ya Amri za Poller. Kutakuwa na amri moja pekee ya pamoja kwa kila seva pangishi ndani ya kundi la Amri za Poller."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "Mchakato 1"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
