msgstr "Muda wa Mwisho wa Uzalishaji wa Mandharinyuma wa Matengenezo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Muda wa juu zaidi ambao hati ya Matengenezo ya Cacti inaweza kuendeshwa bila kutoa hitilafu ya muda kuisha na kusitishwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa Mwisho wa Uzalishaji wa Mandharinyuma wa Spikekill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Muda wa juu zaidi ambao hati ya Spikekill ya Cacti inaweza kuendeshwa bila kutoa hitilafu ya muda kuisha na kusitishwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Mbinu ya Uthibitishaji"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Uthibitishaji wa Ndani</i> - Cacti hushughulikia uthibitishaji wa watumiaji, ambao hukuruhusu kuunda watumiaji na kuwapa haki za kufikia maeneo tofauti ndani ya Cacti.<br><br><i>Uthibitishaji Msingi wa Wavuti</i> - Uthibitishaji hushughulikiwa na seva ya wavuti. Watumiaji wanaweza kuongezwa au kuundwa kiotomatiki wanapoingia kwa mara ya kwanza ikiwa Mtumiaji Kiolezo amefafanuliwa, vinginevyo ruhusa za mgeni zilizofafanuliwa zitatumika.<br><br><i>Uthibitishaji wa LDAP</i> - Huruhusu uthibitishaji dhidi ya seva ya LDAP. Watumiaji wataundwa kiotomatiki wanapoingia kwa mara ya kwanza ikiwa Mtumiaji Kiolezo amefafanuliwa, vinginevyo ruhusa za mgeni zilizofafanuliwa zitatumika. Ikiwa moduli ya LDAP ya PHP haijawashwa, Uthibitishaji wa LDAP hautaonekana kama chaguo linaloweza kuchaguliwa.<br><br><i>Uthibitishaji wa Vikoa Vingi vya LDAP/AD</i> - Huruhusu wasimamizi kusaidia vikundi vingi tofauti kutoka kwa saraka tofauti za LDAP/AD kufikia rasilimali za Cacti. Kama tu Uthibitishaji wa LDAP, moduli ya LDAP ya PHP inahitajika ili kutumia mbinu hii.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Saidia Vidakuzi vya Uthibitishaji"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use.  Note, the client must use HTTPS to leverage this feature."
msgstr "Mtumiaji akithibitisha na kuchagua 'Niweke nimeingia', kidakuzi cha uthibitishaji kitaundwa kwenye kompyuta ya mtumiaji na kumruhusu mtumiaji huyo kuendelea kubaki ameingia. Kidakuzi cha uthibitishaji huisha muda wake baada ya siku 90 za kutotumika. Kumbuka, mteja lazima atumie HTTPS ili kunufaika na kipengele hiki."

