#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Usasishaji wa RRD Unapohitajika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Wezesha Usasishaji wa RRD Unapohitajika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Je, Boost inapaswa kuwezesha usasishaji wa RRD unapohitajika katika Cacti? Ukizima, badiliko hili halitaanza kutumika hadi baada ya mzunguko ujao wa ukusanyaji data. Unapokuwa na Wakusanyaji wa Data wa Mbali, mpangilio huu unahitajika kuwashwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Kisasishaji cha RRD cha Kiwango cha Mfumo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Kabla Usasishaji wa RRD Unapohitajika Haujaondolewa, mwendesho wa poller lazima upite kila wakati"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Ni Mara Ngapi Boost Inapaswa Kusasisha RRD Zote"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Unapowasha Boost, faili zako za RRD husasishwa tu zinapoombwa na mtumiaji, au muda huu unapopita."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Idadi ya Michakato ya Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Idadi ya michakato ya Boost inayofanya kazi kwa pamoja ya kutumia kuchakata RRD zote katika jedwali la Boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Kiwango cha Juu cha Rekodi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Ikiwa jedwali la matokeo la Boost litazidi ukubwa huu, kwa idadi ya rekodi, usasishaji utafanyika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Kiwango cha Juu cha Vipengee vya Chanzo cha Data kwa Kila Mzunguko"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Ili kuboresha utendakazi, kisasishaji cha RRD cha Boost kinahitaji kujua ni Vipengee vingapi vya Chanzo cha Data vinapaswa kurejeshwa katika mzunguko mmoja. Tafadhali kuwa mwangalifu usiweke juu sana kwani utendakazi wa uchoraji wa grafu wakati wa masasisho makubwa unaweza kuathiriwa. Ukikumbana na ucheleweshaji wa uchoraji wa grafu au ukusanyaji data wakati wa masasisho, punguza nambari hii. Thamani chaguo-msingi ni 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Urefu wa Juu wa Hoja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Boost inapotuma amri za usasishaji kwa RRDtool, hazipaswi kuzidi Urefu wa Juu wa Hoja wa mfumo wa uendeshaji. Hii hutofautiana kulingana na mfumo wa uendeshaji na kiwango cha kaneli. Kwa mfano: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ bila kikomo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Kikomo cha Kumbukumbu kwa Boost na Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Kiwango cha juu cha kumbukumbu kwa Poller ya Cacti na Poller ya Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Muda wa Juu wa Kuendesha Hati ya Usasishaji wa RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Ikiwa poller ya Boost itazidi muda huu wa uendeshaji, onyo litawekwa kwenye kumbukumbu ya Cacti,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Boost Debugging"
msgstr "Wezesha Utatuzi wa Hitilafu wa Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set, Boost will log debug information directly to the Boost log file.  Please note, enabling can cause a high I/O rate on the local file system."
msgstr "Ikiwekwa, Boost itaweka kumbukumbu ya maelezo ya utatuzi moja kwa moja kwenye faili ya kumbukumbu ya Boost. Tafadhali kumbuka, kuwezesha kunaweza kusababisha kiwango cha juu cha I/O kwenye mfumo wa faili wa ndani."

