#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>KUMBUKA:</strong> Umeingia katika Kikusanya Data cha Mbali. Kinapokuwa <b>'mtandaoni'</b>, utaweza kutazama na kudhibiti sehemu kubwa ya Tovuti Kuu ya Cacti kana kwamba umeingia humo. Pia, ni muhimu kukumbuka kuwa Vikusanya Data vya Mbali vinahitajika kutumia kipengele cha <b>'Usasishaji Unapohitajika'</b> cha Huduma za Kuongeza Utendaji za Cacti, na daima tunapendekeza kutumia Spine. Kikusanya Data cha Mbali kinapokuwa <b>'nje ya mtandao'</b>, Tovuti ya Vikusanya Data vya Mbali itakuwa na maelezo machache zaidi. Hata hivyo, itahifadhi kwa muda masasisho yote hadi Hifadhidata Kuu ya Cacti na Seva ya Wavuti zitakapofikiwa. Kisha itatuma matokeo ya jedwali lake la Boost kurudi kwenye Hifadhidata Kuu ya Cacti kwa ajili ya usasishaji."

#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>KUMBUKA:</strong> Hadi sasa, hakuna Programu-jalizi Kuu za Cacti ambazo zimeundwa upya kufanya kazi na Vikusanya Data vya Mbali. Kwa hivyo, Programu-jalizi kama vile MacTrack na HMIB, ambazo zinahitaji ufikiaji wa moja kwa moja kwa vifaa, hazitafanya kazi na Vikusanya Data vya Mbali kwa wakati huu. Hata hivyo, programu-jalizi kama vile Thold zitafanya kazi mradi tu Kikusanya Data cha Mbali kiko katika hali ya <b>'mtandaoni'</b>."

