#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Endapo kutatokea matatizo, inapendekezwa sana ufute kache ya kivinjari chako, ufunge kisha ufungue tena kivinjari chako (si kichupo ambacho Cacti iko pekee) na ujaribu tena, kabla ya kuripoti tatizo kwa The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Katika hali chache sana, tumepokea ripoti kutoka kwa watumiaji wanaokumbana na matatizo madogo kutokana na mabadiliko kwenye msimbo.  Matatizo haya husababishwa na kivinjari kuhifadhi msimbo wa kabla ya kusasisha, na ingawa tumechukua hatua za kupunguza uwezekano wa hili, bado linaweza kutokea.  Ikiwa unahitaji maelekezo ya jinsi ya kufuta kache ya kivinjari chako, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> ni mahali pazuri pa kuanzia."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Ikiwa baada ya kufuta kache yako na kuanzisha upya kivinjari chako bado unakumbana na matatizo, tafadhali wasilisha tatizo hilo kwetu nasi tutajaribu kubaini chanzo chake."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Shusha toleo kutoka <strong>%1$s</strong> hadi <strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Inaonekana unashusha hadi toleo la awali.  Mabadiliko ya hifadhidata yaliyofanywa kwa ajili ya toleo jipya hayatabatilishwa na <i>yanaweza</i> kusababisha matatizo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the type of installation"
msgstr "Tafadhali chagua aina ya usakinishaji"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Installation options:"
msgstr "Chaguo za usakinishaji:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Choose this for the Primary site."
msgstr "Chagua hii kwa kituo Kikuu."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "New Primary Server"
msgstr "Seva Kuu Mpya"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "New Remote Poller"
msgstr "Poller ya Mbali Mpya"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Pollers are used to access networks that are not readily accessible to the Primary site."
msgstr "Poller za Mbali hutumika kufikia mitandao ambayo haifikiki kwa urahisi kutoka kituo Kikuu."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following information has been determined from Cacti's configuration file. If it is not correct, please edit \"include/config.php\" before continuing."
msgstr "Maelezo yafuatayo yamepatikana kutoka kwenye faili ya usanidi ya Cacti. Ikiwa si sahihi, tafadhali hariri \"include/config.php\" kabla ya kuendelea."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Local Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Maelezo ya Muunganisho wa Hifadhidata ya Ndani"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Hifadhidata: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database User: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Mtumiaji wa Hifadhidata: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database Hostname: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Jina la Kipangishi cha Hifadhidata: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Port: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Mlango: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Server Operating System Type: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Aina ya Mfumo wa Uendeshaji wa Seva: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Central Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Maelezo ya Muunganisho wa Hifadhidata Kuu"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration Readonly!"
msgstr "Usanidi ni wa Kusoma Pekee!"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Faili yako ya config.php lazima iweze kuandikwa na seva ya wavuti wakati wa usakinishaji ili kusanidi Poller ya Mbali.  Mara usakinishaji utakapokamilika, ni lazima uweke faili hii kuwa ya Kusoma Pekee ili kuzuia matatizo yanayoweza kutokea ya kiusalama."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Usanidi wa Poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Maelezo yako ya Poller ya Mbali ya Cacti hayajajumuishwa kwenye faili yako ya config.php.  Tafadhali kagua config.php.dist, na uweke vigeu: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, n.k.  Vigeu hivi lazima viwekwe na vielekeze kwenye seva yako Kuu ya hifadhidata ya Cacti.  Rekebisha hili kisha ujaribu tena."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Vigeu vya Poller ya Mbali"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Vigeu ambavyo lazima viwekwe katika faili ya config.php ni pamoja na vifuatavyo:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Kisakinishi hupanga $poller_id kiotomatiki na kuiongeza kwenye faili ya config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Mara tu vigeu vyote vinapowekwa kwenye faili ya config.php, lazima pia umpe $rdatabase_username ruhusa ya kufikia seva kuu ya hifadhidata ya Cacti. Fuata utaratibu uleule unaotumia kwa usakinishaji mwingine wowote wa Cacti. Kisha unaweza kubofya kitufe cha 'Jaribu Muunganisho'. Ikiwa jaribio litafaulu utaweza kuendelea na kukamilisha usakinishaji."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Hatua za Ziada Baada ya Usakinishaji"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Ni muhimu kwamba seva Kuu ya Cacti inaweza kuwasiliana kupitia MySQL na kila seva ya mbali ya hifadhidata ya Cacti. Mara tu usakinishaji unapokamilika, lazima uhariri Kikusanya Data cha Mbali na uhakikishe mipangilio ni sahihi. Unaweza kuthibitisha kwa kutumia 'Jaribu Muunganisho' unapohariri Kikusanya Data cha Mbali."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Maeneo Muhimu ya Faili za Binary na Matoleo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Hakikisha thamani hizi zote ni sahihi kabla ya kuendelea."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Njia moja au zaidi zinaonekana si sahihi, haiwezekani kuendelea"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Ukaguzi wa Ruhusa za Saraka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Tafadhali hakikisha ruhusa za saraka zilizo hapa chini ni sahihi kabla ya kuendelea. Wakati wa usakinishaji, saraka hizi zinahitaji kumilikiwa na mtumiaji wa Seva ya Wavuti. Mabadiliko haya ya ruhusa yanahitajika ili kuruhusu Kisakinishi kusakinisha vifurushi vya Violezo vya Kifaa vinavyojumuisha faili za XML na hati (scripts) ambazo zitawekwa kwenye saraka hizi. Ukichagua kutosakinisha vifurushi, kuna hati ya CLI ya 'install_package.php' inayoweza kutumika kutoka kwenye mstari wa amri baada ya usakinishaji kukamilika."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Baada ya usakinishaji kukamilika, unaweza kufanya baadhi ya saraka hizi kuwa za kusoma tu ili kuongeza usalama."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Saraka hizi zitahitajika kubaki na ruhusa ya kusoma na kuandika baada ya usakinishaji ili mchakato wa ulandanishi wa mbali wa Cacti uweze kuzisasisha kadiri Tovuti Kuu ya Cacti inavyobadilika"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Ikiwa unasakinisha vifurushi, mara tu vifurushi vitakaposakinishwa, unapaswa kubadilisha saraka ya hati (scripts) kurudi kuwa ya kusoma tu kwani hii inaleta hatari fulani kwa tovuti."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Kwa wakusanyaji wa mbali (remote pollers), ni muhimu sana kwamba njia utakazokuwa ukizisasisha mara kwa mara, zikiwemo njia za plugins, scripts, na resources ziwe na ufikiaji wa kusoma/kuandika kwani kikusanya data kitalazimika kusasisha njia hizi kutoka kwenye maudhui ya seva kuu ya wavuti."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "Inahitaji Ruhusa ya Kuandika Wakati wa Usakinishaji Tu"

#: lib/installer.php package_import.php
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Haiwezi Kuandikwa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "Inahitaji Ruhusa ya Kuandika baada ya Usakinishaji Kukamilika"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Matatizo yanayoweza kutokea ya ruhusa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the cacti folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Tafadhali hakikisha kuwa seva yako ya wavuti ina ufikiaji wa kusoma/kuandika kwenye folda za cacti zinazoonyesha hitilafu hapa chini."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr "Ikiwa SELinux imewashwa kwenye seva yako, unaweza kuizima kabisa, au kuizima kwa muda kisha uongeze ruhusa zinazofaa kwa kutumia zana za mstari wa amri za SELinux."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "The user '%s' should have MODIFY permission to enable read/write."
msgstr "Mtumiaji '%s' anapaswa kuwa na ruhusa ya MODIFY ili kuwezesha kusoma/kuandika."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "An example of how to set folder permissions is shown here, though you may need to adjust this depending on your operating system, user accounts and desired permissions."
msgstr "Mfano wa jinsi ya kuweka ruhusa za folda umeonyeshwa hapa, ingawa huenda ukahitaji kurekebisha hili kulingana na mfumo wako wa uendeshaji, akaunti za watumiaji na ruhusa unazotaka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "EXAMPLE:"
msgstr "MFANO:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once installation has completed the CSRF path, should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Mara tu usakinishaji unapokamilika, njia ya CSRF inapaswa kuwekwa kuwa ya kusoma tu."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Folda zote zinaweza kuandikwa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Linux kernel security modules"
msgstr "Moduli za usalama za kiini cha Linux"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti needs to establish network connections, execute binaries and write files to work. Linux security features such as <b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> or <b>ModSecurity</b> may cause Cacti to become inoperable in some configurations. If problems occur, check the settings of these security tools.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "Cacti inahitaji kuanzisha miunganisho ya mtandao, kutekeleza faili za binary na kuandika faili ili kufanya kazi. Vipengele vya usalama vya Linux kama vile <b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> au <b>ModSecurity</b> vinaweza kusababisha Cacti kutofanya kazi katika baadhi ya usanidi. Matatizo yakitokea, kagua mipangilio ya zana hizi za usalama.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Ulinzi wa Orodha Salama (Whitelist) ya Uthibitishaji wa Ingizo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Mbinu za Kuingiza Data za Cacti zinazoita hati (script) zinaweza kutumiwa vibaya kwa njia ambazo mtu asiye msimamizi anaweza kuharibu faili zinazomilikiwa na akaunti ya poller, na katika hali ambapo mtu anaendesha poller ya Cacti kama root, inaweza kuathiri mfumo wa uendeshaji na kuruhusu washambuliaji kutumia vibaya miundombinu yako."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Kwa hivyo, matoleo kadhaa yaliyopita, Cacti iliboreshwa ili kutoa uwezo wa Orodha Salama (Whitelist) kwenye aina hizi za Mbinu za Kuingiza Data. Ingawa hili linaimarisha usalama wa Cacti kwa kina zaidi, linaongeza kiasi cha kazi kinachohitajika na msimamizi wa Cacti kuagiza na kudhibiti Violezo na Vifurushi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Jinsi Orodha Salama (Whitelisting) inavyofanya kazi ni kwamba unapoagiza Mbinu ya Kuingiza Data kwa mara ya kwanza, au unapoagiza upya Mbinu ya Kuingiza Data, na hati au hoja (arguments) zikibadilika kwa njia yoyote, Mbinu ya Kuingiza Data, na Vyanzo vyote vya Data vinavyolingana vitazimwa mara moja hadi msimamizi athibitishe kuwa Mbinu ya Kuingiza Data ni halali."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Ili kurahisisha kutambua Mbinu za Kuingiza Data zilizo katika hali hii, tumetoa skripti ya uthibitishaji katika saraka ya CLI ya Cacti inayoweza kuendeshwa kwa chaguo zifuatazo:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Chaguo hili la skripti litatafuta Mbinu zozote za Kuingiza Data ambazo zimepigwa marufuku kwa sasa na kutoa maelezo kuhusu sababu."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Chaguo hili la skripti litaondoa marufuku kwa Mbinu za Kuingiza Data ambazo zimepigwa marufuku kwa sasa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Chaguo hili la skripti litawezesha tena Vyanzo vyovyote vya Data vilivyozimwa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "Inapendekezwa sana usasishe faili yako ya config.php ili kuwezesha kipengele hiki kwa kuondoa alama ya maoni kwenye kibadilika cha <b>$input_whitelist</b> kisha uendeshe chaguo tatu za skripti ya CLI zilizo hapo juu baada ya usakinishaji kupitia wavuti kukamilika.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Tia alama kwenye kisanduku cha tiki kilicho hapa chini ili kukiri kuwa umesoma na kuelewa suala hili la usalama"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Nimesoma taarifa hii"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Admin email address"
msgstr "Anwani ya barua pepe ya msimamizi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In case of problems cacti can send emails to the administrator. The address filled in here will be assigned to the admin account and \"Notify Primary Admin of Issue\" will be enabled. You can change this setting and the email address later. Do not forget to set up the email settings after installation."
msgstr "Matatizo yakitokea, Cacti inaweza kutuma barua pepe kwa msimamizi. Anwani itakayojazwa hapa itaunganishwa na akaunti ya msimamizi na kipengele cha \"Arifu Msimamizi Mkuu Kuhusu Tatizo\" kitawezeshwa. Unaweza kubadilisha mpangilio huu na anwani ya barua pepe baadaye. Usisahau kuweka mipangilio ya barua pepe baada ya usakinishaji."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Wasifu Chaguomsingi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources. This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Cacti Server host. Long retention profiles store more data, so they take up more disk capacity. Their advantage is that older data is not as consolidated and is therefore more accurate than using shorter retention."
msgstr "Tafadhali chagua Wasifu Chaguomsingi wa Chanzo cha Data utakaotumika kukusanya taarifa kutoka vyanzo. Huu ndio muda wa juu zaidi kati ya uchanganuzi wa vifaa ili kupata taarifa, kwa hivyo kadiri muda wa ukusanyaji unavyokuwa mfupi, ndivyo mzigo wa kazi unavyoongezeka kwenye seva mwenyeji ya Cacti. Wasifu wa uhifadhi wa muda mrefu huhifadhi data zaidi, hivyo hutumia nafasi kubwa zaidi ya diski. Faida yake ni kwamba data ya zamani haijaunganishwa sana kwa muhtasari na kwa hivyo ni sahihi zaidi kuliko kutumia uhifadhi wa muda mfupi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Pia, chagua muda wa Cron uliokusudiwa au uliosanidiwa ambao ungependa kutumia kwa Ukusanyaji wa Data."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Muda wa Cron"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Automation Network"
msgstr "Mtandao Chaguomsingi wa Uotomatishaji"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "Cacti inaweza kuchanganua mtandao kiotomatiki mara tu usakinishaji unapokamilika. Hii itatumia masafa ya mtandao yaliyo hapa chini kubainisha masafa ya anwani za IP zinazoweza kuchanganuliwa. Seti iliyoainishwa awali ya chaguo imewekwa kwa ajili ya uchanganuzi ambayo inajumuisha kutumia jumuiya za 'public' na 'private'."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Ikiwa vifaa vyako vinahitaji seti tofauti ya chaguo zitumike kwanza, unaweza kuzibainisha hapa chini na zitatumika kabla ya chaguomsingi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All options may be adjusted post installation"
msgstr "Chaguo zote zinaweza kurekebishwa baada ya usakinishaji"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Options"
msgstr "Chaguo Chaguomsingi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Scan Mode"
msgstr "Hali ya Uchanganuzi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Network Range"
msgstr "Masafa ya Mtandao"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Defaults"
msgstr "Chaguomsingi za Ziada"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional SNMP Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Ziada za SNMP"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Error Locating Profiles"
msgstr "Hitilafu katika Kupata Wasifu"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The installation cannot continue because no profiles could be found."
msgstr "Usakinishaji hauwezi kuendelea kwa sababu hakuna wasifu wowote uliopatikana."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This may occur if you have a blank database and have not yet imported the cacti.sql file"
msgstr "Hili linaweza kutokea ikiwa una hifadhidata tupu na bado hujaingiza faili ya cacti.sql"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Template Setup"
msgstr "Usanidi wa Violezo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to update during the Upgrade."
msgstr "Tafadhali chagua Violezo vya Vifaa ambavyo ungependa kusasisha wakati wa Uboreshaji."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Updating Templates that you have already made modifications to is not advisable.  The Upgrade of the Templates will NOT remove modifications to Graph and Data Templates, and can lead to unexpected behavior.  However, if you have not made changes to any Graph, Data Query, or Data Template, reimporting the Package should not have any affect.  In that case, you would have to 'Sync Graphs' to from the Templates after update."
msgstr "Kusasisha Violezo ambavyo tayari umevifanyia marekebisho haipendekezwi. Uboreshaji wa Violezo HAUTAONDOA marekebisho kwenye Violezo vya Grafu na Data, na unaweza kusababisha utendakazi usiotarajiwa. Hata hivyo, ikiwa hujafanya mabadiliko kwenye Grafu, Hoji ya Data, au Kiolezo cha Data chochote, kuingiza upya Kifurushi hakupaswi kuwa na athari yoyote. Katika hali hiyo, utahitaji kutumia 'Sawazisha Grafu' kutoka kwenye Violezo baada ya kusasisha."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to use after the Install.  If your Operating System is Windows, you need to ensure that you select the 'Windows Device' Template.  If your Operating System is Linux/UNIX, make sure you select the 'Local Linux Machine' Device Template."
msgstr "Tafadhali chagua Violezo vya Vifaa ambavyo ungependa kutumia baada ya Usakinishaji. Ikiwa Mfumo wako wa Uendeshaji ni Windows, unahitaji kuhakikisha umechagua Kiolezo cha 'Windows Device'. Ikiwa Mfumo wako wa Uendeshaji ni Linux/UNIX, hakikisha umechagua Kiolezo cha Kifaa cha 'Local Linux Machine'."

#: lib/installer.php package.php package_import.php
msgid "Homepage"
msgstr "Ukurasa wa Mwanzo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Device Templates allow you to monitor and graph a vast assortment of data within Cacti.  After you select the desired Device Templates, press 'Next' and the installation will complete.  Please be patient on this step, as the importation of the Device Templates can take a few minutes."
msgstr "Violezo vya Vifaa vinakuwezesha kufuatilia na kuchora grafu ya aina mbalimbali za data ndani ya Cacti. Baada ya kuchagua Violezo vya Vifaa unavyotaka, bonyeza 'Ifuatayo' na usakinishaji utakamilika. Tafadhali kuwa na subira katika hatua hii, kwani uingizaji wa Violezo vya Vifaa unaweza kuchukua dakika chache."

