#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "Inapendekezwa SANA uwashe InnoDB katika toleo lolote la %s lililo juu ya 5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Unapotumia Cacti na lugha nyingine mbali na Kiingereza, ni muhimu kutumia aina ya upangaji wa herufi ya utf8mb4_unicode_ci kwani baadhi ya herufi huchukua zaidi ya baiti moja."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Unapotumia Cacti na lugha nyingine mbali na Kiingereza, ni muhimu kutumia seti ya herufi ya utf8mb4 kwani baadhi ya herufi huchukua zaidi ya baiti moja."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Inapendekezwa uwashe InnoDB katika toleo lolote la %s lililo juu ya 5.1."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Kulingana na idadi ya waingiaji na matumizi ya mkusanyaji data wa spine, %s itahitaji miunganisho mingi. Hesabu ya spine ni: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), kisha lazima uache nafasi ya ziada kwa miunganisho ya watumiaji, ambayo itabadilika kulingana na idadi ya akaunti zinazoingia kwa wakati mmoja."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Kuweka kache ya majedwali kuwa kubwa zaidi kunamaanisha shughuli chache za kufungua/kufunga faili unapotumia innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Kwa uwezo wa ukusanyaji wa mbali, kiasi kikubwa cha data kitasawazishwa kutoka seva kuu hadi kwa wakusanyaji wa mbali. Kwa hivyo, weka thamani hii kwenye 16M au zaidi."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Cacti Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Ikiwa unatumia Cacti Performance Booster na kuchagua injini ya uhifadhi wa kumbukumbu, lazima uwe mwangalifu kusafisha bafa yako ya Performance Booster kabla mfumo haujaishiwa na nafasi ya jedwali la kumbukumbu. Hili hufanywa kwa njia mbili: kwanza, kupunguza ukubwa wa safuwima yako ya matokeo hadi ukubwa unaofaa tu. Safuwima hii iko kwenye majedwali ya poller_output na poller_output_boost. Jambo la pili unaloweza kufanya ni kutenga kumbukumbu zaidi kwa majedwali ya kumbukumbu. Tumechagua kwa hiari thamani inayopendekezwa ya 10%% ya kumbukumbu ya mfumo, lakini ikiwa unatumia diski za SSD, au una mfumo mdogo zaidi, unaweza kupuuza pendekezo hili au kuchagua injini nyingine ya uhifadhi. Unaweza kuona matumizi yanayotarajiwa ya majedwali ya Performance Booster chini ya Dashibodi -> Huduma za Mfumo -> Tazama Hali ya Boost."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Unapotekeleza maswali madogo (subqueries), kuwa na ukubwa mkubwa zaidi wa jedwali la muda huweka majedwali hayo ya muda kwenye kumbukumbu."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If this number is negative, reduce the innodb_buffer_pool_size until the join_buffer_size turns positive, but allocate approximately from between 25%-50% of memory to the innodb_buffer_pool_size if the database is hosted on the Cacti server, or upto 80% of the systems memory if the database is separate from the Cacti web server.  However, try to not go below the default of 262,144.  When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80% if the database is hosted on the Cacti web server and less if you intend to have very large RRDfiles or hundreds of thousands to millions long term."
msgstr "Ikiwa nambari hii ni hasi, punguza innodb_buffer_pool_size hadi join_buffer_size iwe chanya, lakini tenga takriban kati ya 25%-50% ya kumbukumbu kwa innodb_buffer_pool_size ikiwa hifadhidata inapangishwa kwenye seva ya Cacti, au hadi 80% ya kumbukumbu ya mfumo ikiwa hifadhidata iko tofauti na seva ya wavuti ya Cacti. Hata hivyo, jaribu kutoshuka chini ya chaguo-msingi la 262,144. Wakati wa kufanya miunganisho (joins), ikiwa iko chini ya ukubwa huu, itawekwa kwenye kumbukumbu na kamwe haitaandikwa kwenye faili ya muda. Kwa kuwa huu ni mgao wa kumbukumbu kwa kila muunganisho, tahadhari lazima ichukuliwe ili kutouongeza juu sana. Jumla ya join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + kumbukumbu ya msingi ya MySQL/MariaDB inapaswa kuwa chini ya 80% ikiwa hifadhidata inapangishwa kwenye seva ya wavuti ya Cacti na chini ya hapo ikiwa unakusudia kuwa na faili kubwa sana za RRD au mamia ya maelfu hadi mamilioni kwa muda mrefu."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If this number is negative, reduce the innodb_buffer_pool_size until the sort_buffer_size turns positive, but allocate approximately from between 25%-50% of memory to the innodb_buffer_pool_size if the database is hosted on the Cacti server, or upto 80% of the system memory if the database is separate from the Cacti web server.  However, try to not go below the default setting of 2,097,152.  A sort buffer performs sorts for some queries using ORDER BY or GROUP BY. Configuring sort_buffer_size decides how much memory will be allocated for sort queries.  The sort_buffer_size may need to be adjusted from the default if the workload requires a significant number of sort queries. The sort_buffer_size is defined on a per-session variable.  Use the same equation as that of the join_buffer_size to determine the per connection possible memory."
msgstr "Ikiwa nambari hii ni hasi, punguza innodb_buffer_pool_size hadi sort_buffer_size iwe chanya, lakini tenga takriban kati ya 25%-50% ya kumbukumbu kwa innodb_buffer_pool_size ikiwa hifadhidata inapangishwa kwenye seva ya Cacti, au hadi 80% ya kumbukumbu ya mfumo ikiwa hifadhidata iko tofauti na seva ya wavuti ya Cacti. Hata hivyo, jaribu kutoshuka chini ya mpangilio chaguo-msingi wa 2,097,152. Bafa ya kupanga (sort buffer) hupanga baadhi ya maswali kwa kutumia ORDER BY au GROUP BY. Kusanidi sort_buffer_size huamua ni kiasi gani cha kumbukumbu kitatengwa kwa maswali ya kupanga. Huenda ikahitajika kurekebisha sort_buffer_size kutoka kwa chaguo-msingi ikiwa mzigo wa kazi unahitaji idadi kubwa ya maswali ya kupanga. sort_buffer_size hufafanuliwa kama kigezo cha kila kipindi (per-session). Tumia mlinganyo uleule wa join_buffer_size ili kubaini kumbukumbu inayowezekana kwa kila muunganisho."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Unapotumia uhifadhi wa InnoDB, ni muhimu kuweka nafasi za majedwali yako zikiwa zimetengwa. Hili hurahisisha usimamizi wa majedwali kwa watumiaji wa muda mrefu wa %s. Ikiwa unaendesha huku kipengele hiki kikiwa kimezimwa kwa sasa, unaweza kuhamia kwenye uhifadhi wa kila faili kwa kuwasha kipengele hicho, na kisha kuendesha kauli ya alter kwenye majedwali yote ya InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Cacti tables."
msgstr "Unapotumia innodb_file_per_table, ni muhimu kuweka innodb_file_format kuwa Barracuda. Mpangilio huu utaruhusu fahirisi ndefu zaidi ambazo ni muhimu kwa baadhi ya majedwali ya Cacti."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "Ikiwa majedwali yako yana fahirisi kubwa sana, lazima ufanye kazi ukiwa na innodb_file_format ya Barracuda na innodb_large_prefix ikiwa sawa na 1. Kushindwa kufanya hivi kunaweza kusababisha programu-jalizi zishindwe kuunda majedwali ipasavyo."

#: lib/utility.php
#, no-php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size.  If you database is very large or remote, you can consider increasing this size.  If remote, it can by as high as 80% of the systems memory.  However, cautions must be taken to reduce the swappiness of the system, or to remove swap to keep the system from swapping."
msgstr "InnoDB itashikilia majedwali na fahirisi nyingi iwezekanavyo kwenye kumbukumbu ya mfumo. Kwa hivyo, unapaswa kufanya innodb_buffer_pool iwe kubwa ya kutosha kushikilia majedwali na fahirisi nyingi iwezekanavyo kwenye kumbukumbu. Kuangalia ukubwa wa saraka ya /var/lib/mysql/cacti kutasaidia kuamua thamani hii. Tunapendekeza 25%% ya jumla ya kumbukumbu ya mfumo wako, lakini mahitaji yako yatatofautiana kulingana na ukubwa wa mfumo wako. Ikiwa hifadhidata yako ni kubwa sana au iko mbali, unaweza kufikiria kuongeza ukubwa huu. Ikiwa iko mbali, inaweza kuwa juu hadi 80% ya kumbukumbu ya mfumo. Hata hivyo, tahadhari lazima zichukuliwe ili kupunguza swappiness ya mfumo, au kuondoa swap ili kuzuia mfumo kufanya swapping."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This setting should remain ON unless your Cacti instances are running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Mpangilio huu unapaswa kubaki ON isipokuwa instansi zako za Cacti zinaendeshwa kwenye ZFS au FusionI/O ambazo zote zina uandishi wa majalada wa ndani ili kushughulikia kuzimika kwa ghafla kwa mfumo. Hata hivyo, ikiwa una umeme mzuri sana, na mifumo yako haikwami mara kwa mara na una nakala rudufu, kuweka mpangilio huu kuwa OFF kunaweza kukupatia ongezeko la karibu 50% katika utendakazi wa hifadhidata."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Hapa ndipo metadata huhifadhiwa. Ikiwa ungekuwa na majedwali mengi, ingefaa kuongeza thamani hii."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Hoja korofi hazipaswi kulazimisha hifadhidata kutopatikana kwa wengine. Sitisha hoja hizi kabla hazijaharibu mfumo wako."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Utendakazi wa juu zaidi wa I/O hutokea unapotumia mbinu ya O_DIRECT kusafisha kurasa."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Kuweka thamani hii kuwa 2 kunamaanisha kuwa utasafisha miamala yote kila sekunde badala ya wakati wa kuthibitisha (commit). Hii inaruhusu %s kuandika mara chache zaidi."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Kwa hifadhi ya kisasa ya aina ya SSD, kuwa na nyuzi nyingi za io kuna manufaa kwa programu zilizo na sifa za matumizi ya juu ya io."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, the you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Kuanzia %1$s %2$s, unaweza kudhibiti ni mara ngapi %3$s husafisha miamala kwenda kwenye diski. Thamani chaguo-msingi ni sekunde 1, lakini katika mifumo yenye I/O ya juu, kuweka thamani kubwa kuliko 1 kunaweza kuruhusu I/O ya diski kuwa ya mfuatano zaidi"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Kwa hifadhi ya kisasa ya aina ya SSD, kuwa na nyuzi nyingi za io za kusoma kuna manufaa kwa programu zilizo na sifa za matumizi ya juu ya io. Kulingana na matoleo yako ya MariaDB/MySQL, thamani hii inaweza kufikia hadi 64. Lakini jaribu kuweka nambari hiyo chini ya jumla ya nyuzi zako za SMT kwenye seva ya hifadhidata."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Kwa hifadhi ya kisasa ya aina ya SSD, kuwa na nyuzi nyingi za io za kuandika kuna manufaa kwa programu zilizo na sifa za matumizi ya juu ya io. Kulingana na matoleo yako ya MariaDB/MySQL, thamani hii inaweza kufikia hadi 64. Lakini jaribu kuweka nambari hiyo chini ya jumla ya nyuzi zako za SMT kwenye seva ya hifadhidata."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s itagawanya innodb_buffer_pool katika maeneo ya kumbukumbu ili kuboresha utendakazi kwa matoleo ya MariaDB chini ya 10.5. Thamani ya juu zaidi ni 64, lakini haipaswi kuzidi idadi ya viini/nyuzi za CPU. Wakati innodb_buffer_pool yako ni chini ya 1GB, unapaswa kutumia ukubwa wa hifadhi ya buffer ukigawanywa na 128MB. Endelea kutumia mlinganyo huu hadi upeo wa idadi ya viini vya CPU au 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL upto and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s itagawanya innodb_buffer_pool katika maeneo ya kumbukumbu ili kuboresha utendakazi kwa matoleo ya MySQL hadi na kujumuisha MySQL 8.0. Thamani ya juu zaidi ni 64, lakini haipaswi kuzidi idadi ya viini/nyuzi za CPU. Wakati innodb_buffer_pool yako ni chini ya 1GB, unapaswa kutumia ukubwa wa hifadhi ya buffer ukigawanywa na 128MB. Endelea kutumia mlinganyo huu hadi upeo wa idadi ya viini vya CPU au 64."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Ikiwa una diski za SSD, tumia pendekezo hili. Ikiwa una diski kuu za kawaida, tumia 200 * idadi ya diski zinazofanya kazi kwenye safu (array). Ikiwa unatumia NVMe au PCIe Flash, nambari kubwa zaidi hadi 100000 zinaweza kutumika."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Ikiwa una diski za SSD, tumia pendekezo hili. Ikiwa una diski kuu za kawaida, tumia 2000 * idadi ya diski zinazofanya kazi kwenye safu (array). Ikiwa unatumia NVMe au PCIe Flash, nambari kubwa zaidi hadi 200000 zinaweza kutumika."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, set this to 0. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "Ikiwa una diski za SSD, weka hii kuwa 0. Vinginevyo, usiweke mpangilio huu."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Kwa hifadhi ya kisasa ya aina ya SSD, kuwa na nyuzi nyingi za io za kusoma kuna manufaa kwa programu zilizo na sifa za matumizi ya juu ya io."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Kwa hifadhi ya kisasa ya aina ya SSD, kuwa na nyuzi nyingi za io za kuandika kuna manufaa kwa programu zilizo na sifa za matumizi ya juu ya io."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Unapotumia MariaDB 10.2.4 na kuendelea, mpangilio huu unapaswa kuwa umezimwa ikiwa atomic writes zimewashwa. Kwa hivyo, tafadhali washa atomic writes badala ya double write buffer kwani itaongeza utendakazi."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Unapotumia MariaDB 10.2.4 na kuendelea, unaweza kutumia atomic writes badala ya doublewrite buffer ili kuongeza utendakazi."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MariaDB 11.8 enabled innodb_snapshot_isolation=ON by default. This causes severe lock contention: UPDATE statements can block for tens of thousands of seconds on small tables under concurrent load, which stalls the Cacti poller. Set innodb_snapshot_isolation=OFF in your [mysqld] configuration. See MDEV-39628."
msgstr "MariaDB 11.8 iliwasha innodb_snapshot_isolation=ON kwa chaguo-msingi. Hii husababisha mshindano mkali wa kufuli: kauli za UPDATE zinaweza kuzuia kwa makumi ya maelfu ya sekunde kwenye majedwali madogo chini ya mzigo wa pamoja, jambo ambalo husimamisha Cacti poller. Weka innodb_snapshot_isolation=OFF katika usanidi wako wa [mysqld]. Tazama MDEV-39628."

