msgstr "Seva"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Cacti will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user.<br><br>For One-Time Password (OTP/MFA) logins, do not use a space delimited multi-server list.  On a failed bind Cacti advances to the next server and re-binds with the same credentials, and the already-consumed one-time code will be rejected.  Instead enter a single, resilient DNS name fronted by a DNS load balancer (VIP) so that server failover is handled below Cacti and only one authentication bind is ever performed."
msgstr "Orodha iliyotenganishwa kwa nafasi ya majina ya seva pangishi ya DNS au anwani za IP za seva halali za LDAP. Cacti itajaribu kutumia seva za LDAP kutoka kushoto kwenda kulia ili kuthibitisha mtumiaji.<br><br>Kwa kuingia kwa Nenosiri la Wakati Mmoja (OTP/MFA), usitumie orodha ya seva nyingi iliyotenganishwa kwa nafasi. Muunganisho (bind) unaposhindikana, Cacti huenda kwa seva inayofuata na kuunganisha tena kwa vitambulisho vilevile, na msimbo wa wakati mmoja uliokwisha kutumika utakataliwa. Badala yake, weka jina moja la DNS lenye ustahimilivu linalosimamiwa na kisawazishaji mzigo cha DNS (VIP) ili kubadilisha seva kunaposhindikana kushughulikiwe chini ya Cacti na uthibitishaji mmoja tu ufanywe."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "dc1.example.com dc2.example.com"
msgstr "dc1.example.com dc2.example.com"

