msgstr "Iwapo LDAP ithibitishe Vyeti vya TLS vinapopokelewa na Mteja."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Marejeleo"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "Washa au Zima marejeleo ya LDAP. Yakizimwa, yanaweza kuongeza kasi ya utafutaji."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Hali"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Hali ambayo Cacti itajaribu kuthibitisha utambulisho dhidi ya seva ya LDAP.<blockquote><i>Hakuna Utafutaji</i> - Hakuna utafutaji wa Jina la Kipekee (DN) unaofanyika, jaribu tu kuunganisha ukitumia muundo wa Jina la Kipekee (DN) uliotolewa.<br><br><i>Utafutaji Bila Utambulisho</i> - Inajaribu kutafuta jina la mtumiaji katika saraka ya LDAP kupitia muunganisho usio na utambulisho ili kupata Jina la Kipekee (DN) la mtumiaji.<br><br><i>Utafutaji Maalum</i> - Inajaribu kutafuta jina la mtumiaji katika saraka ya LDAP kupitia Jina la Kipekee (DN) Maalum na Nenosiri Maalum kwa ajili ya muunganisho ili kupata Jina la Kipekee (DN) la mtumiaji.<br><br><i>Nenosiri za Matumizi ya Mara Moja (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti inaunganisha nenosiri la mtumiaji mara moja tu, wakati wa uthibitishaji wa mwisho. <i>Hakuna Utafutaji</i> haifanyi utafutaji wowote wa saraka na inaunganisha moja kwa moja kwa kutumia kiolezo cha Jina la Kipekee (DN), kwa hivyo ni salama kwa OTP wakati kiolezo cha DN pekee kinapomtambulisha mtumiaji. Wakati utafutaji wa saraka unahitajika ili kutatua DN, tumia <i>Utafutaji Maalum</i> ukiwa na akaunti maalum ya huduma (au <i>Utafutaji Bila Utambulisho</i> ambapo saraka inaruhusu) ili utafutaji usiwahi kutumia msimbo wa matumizi ya mara moja. Kwa utekelezaji imara wa OTP tumia jina moja la kigawanya mzigo cha DNS katika sehemu ya Seva badala ya orodha ya seva nyingi iliyotenganishwa kwa nafasi, ambayo ingejaribu tena kuunganisha kwa kutumia nenosiri la matumizi ya mara moja ambalo tayari limetumika."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Jina Bainifu (DN)"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Sintaksia ya \"Jina Bainifu\", inayotumika kwa usanidi wa OpenLDAP na Windows AD, hutoa urahisi katika kufafanua utambulisho wa mtumiaji. Kwa OpenLDAP, umbizo hufuata muundo huu: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD hutoa sintaksia mbadala: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, inayojulikana kwa kawaida kama \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". Katika muktadha huu, \"&lt;username&gt;\" huwakilisha jina maalum la mtumiaji lililotolewa wakati wa kuingia. Hii ni muhimu sana unapofanya kazi katika hali ya \"Hakuna Utafutaji\", au wakati \"Hitaji Uanachama wa Kikundi\" imewashwa."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "uid=<username>,ou=people,dc=example,dc=com"
msgstr "uid=<username>,ou=people,dc=example,dc=com"

#: login_providers.php user_admin.php
msgid "Group Membership"
msgstr "Uanachama wa Kikundi"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Jina Bainifu la Kikundi (DN)"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that the user must be a member of in order to login. Leave blank to allow any successfully authenticated user to login."
msgstr "Jina Bainifu la kikundi ambacho mtumiaji lazima awe mwanachama wake ili aweze kuingia. Acha wazi ili kuruhusu mtumiaji yeyote aliyethibitishwa kwa mafanikio kuingia."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "ou=cacti-admins,dc=example,dc=com"
msgstr "ou=cacti-admins,dc=example,dc=com"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Sifa ya Mwanachama wa Kikundi"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Hii inarejelea sifa maalum ndani ya saraka ya LDAP inayohifadhi majina ya watumiaji wa wanachama wa kikundi. Ni muhimu kuhakikisha kuwa thamani ya sifa inalingana na usanidi uliobainishwa katika \"Jina Bainifu\" au kwamba thamani halisi ya sifa inaweza kutafutwa kwa kutumia mipangilio iliyoelezwa katika \"Jina Bainifu\"."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "memberUid"
msgstr "memberUid"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "Aina ya Mwanachama wa Kikundi"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "Hufafanua iwapo watumiaji wanatumia Jina Bainifu kamili au Jina la Mtumiaji pekee katika Sifa ya Mwanachama wa Kikundi iliyofafanuliwa."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Search Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Utafutaji"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Msingi wa Utafutaji"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> or <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."
msgstr "Msingi wa utafutaji wa kutafuta katika saraka ya LDAP, kama vile <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> au <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "ou=people,dc=example,dc=com"
msgstr "ou=people,dc=example,dc=com"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "Kichujio cha Utafutaji"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  \"&lt;username&gt\" is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt."
msgstr "Kichujio cha utafutaji cha kutumia kumpata mtumiaji katika saraka ya LDAP, kama vile kwa Windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> au kwa OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  \"&lt;username&gt\" hubadilishwa na jina la mtumiaji lililotolewa kwenye kidokezo cha kuingia."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "(&(objectClass=account)(uid=<username>))"
msgstr "(&(objectClass=account)(uid=<username>))"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Jina Bainifu la Utafutaji (DN)"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Distinguished Name for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Jina Bainifu (Distinguished Name) kwa ajili ya uunganishaji mahususi wa utafutaji kwenye saraka ya LDAP."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "cn=svc-cacti,ou=service,dc=example,dc=com"
msgstr "cn=svc-cacti,ou=service,dc=example,dc=com"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Search Password"
msgstr "Nenosiri la Utafutaji"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Password for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Nenosiri kwa ajili ya uunganishaji mahususi wa utafutaji kwenye saraka ya LDAP."

#: login_providers.php
