msgid "Remote Database SSL Information"
msgstr "Taarifa za SSL za Hifadhidata ya Mbali"

#: pollers.php
msgid "Starting in MariaDB 11.4 and above, SSL is autonegotiated between the client and server.  So, this option may not be required"
msgstr "Kuanzia MariaDB 11.4 na kuendelea, SSL hupatanishwa kiotomatiki kati ya mteja na seva. Kwa hivyo, huenda chaguo hili lisihitajike"

