msgid "If the remote database uses SSL to connect, and it's prior to MariaDB 11.4, check the checkbox below to enter the details."
msgstr "Ikiwa hifadhidata ya mbali inatumia SSL kuunganisha, na ni kabla ya MariaDB 11.4, weka alama kwenye kisanduku cha kuteua hapa chini ili kuingiza maelezo."

#: pollers.php
msgid "Remote Database SSL Key"
msgstr "Ufunguo wa SSL wa Hifadhidata ya Mbali"

#: pollers.php
msgid "The file holding the SSL Key to use to connect to the remote database."
msgstr "Faili linaloshikilia Ufunguo wa SSL wa kutumia kuunganisha na hifadhidata ya mbali."

#: pollers.php
msgid "Remote Database SSL Certificate"
msgstr "Cheti cha SSL cha Hifadhidata ya Mbali"

