msgid "The file holding the SSL Certificate to use to connect to the remote database."
msgstr "Faili linaloshikilia Cheti cha SSL cha kutumia kuunganisha na hifadhidata ya mbali."

#: pollers.php
msgid "Remote Database SSL Authority"
msgstr "Mamlaka ya SSL ya Hifadhidata ya Mbali"

#: pollers.php
msgid "The file holding the SSL Certificate Authority to use to connect to the remote database.  This is an optional parameter that can be required by the database provider if they have started SSL using the --ssl-mode=VERIFY_CA option."
msgstr "Faili linaloshikilia Mamlaka ya Cheti cha SSL ya kutumia kuunganisha na hifadhidata ya mbali. Hiki ni kigezo cha hiari ambacho kinaweza kuhitajika na mtoa huduma wa hifadhidata ikiwa wameanzisha SSL kwa kutumia chaguo la --ssl-mode=VERIFY_CA."

#: pollers.php
msgid "Remote Database SSL Authorities directory"
msgstr "Saraka ya Mamlaka za SSL za Hifadhidata ya Mbali"

#: pollers.php
msgid "The file path to the directory that contains the trusted SSL Certificate Authority certificates. This is an optional parameter that can used instead of giving the path to an individual Certificate Authority file. This parameter can be required by the database provider if they have started SSL using the --ssl-mode=VERIFY_CA option."
msgstr "Njia ya faili kwenda kwenye saraka iliyo na vyeti vinavyoaminika vya Mamlaka ya Cheti cha SSL. Hiki ni kigezo cha hiari kinachoweza kutumika badala ya kutoa njia ya faili moja la Mamlaka ya Cheti. Kigezo hiki kinaweza kuhitajika na mtoa huduma wa hifadhidata ikiwa wameanzisha SSL kwa kutumia chaguo la --ssl-mode=VERIFY_CA."

#: pollers.php
msgid "Provides a way to disable verification of the server's SSL certificate Common Name against the server's hostname when connecting. This verification is enabled by default."
msgstr "Hutoa njia ya kuzima uthibitishaji wa Jina la Kawaida (Common Name) la cheti cha SSL cha seva dhidi ya jina la mwenyeji la seva wakati wa kuunganisha. Uthibitishaji huu umewashwa kwa chaguomsingi."

