#: utilities.php
msgid "The Cacti Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Kumbukumbu ya Cacti huhifadhi takwimu, hitilafu na ujumbe mwingine kulingana na mipangilio ya mfumo. Taarifa hii inaweza kutumika kutambua matatizo ya poller na programu."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Allows Administrators to browse the user log.  Administrators can filter and export the log as well."
msgstr "Huruhusu Wasimamizi kuvinjari kumbukumbu ya mtumiaji. Wasimamizi wanaweza kuchuja na kuhamisha kumbukumbu pia."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "Usimamizi wa Kache ya Poller"

#: utilities.php
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Hii ndiyo data inayopitishwa kwa poller kila inapoendeshwa. Data hii kisha hutekelezwa/hutafsiriwa na matokeo huingizwa kwenye faili za RRD kwa ajili ya kuchora grafu au kwenye hifadhidata kwa ajili ya kuonyeshwa."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Kache ya Hoji ya Data huhifadhi taarifa zilizokusanywa kutoka aina za ingizo za Hoji ya Data. Thamani kutoka sehemu hizi zinaweza kutumika katika eneo la maandishi la Grafu kwa Lejendi, Lebo Wima, na GPRINTS pamoja na katika CDEF."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Jenga Upya Kache ya Poller"

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Kache ya Poller itazalishwa upya ukichagua chaguo hili. Tumia chaguo hili tu iwapo hifadhidata imeanguka na unakumbana na matatizo baada ya kuanguka na tayari umeendesha zana za kurekebisha hifadhidata. Vinginevyo, ikiwa una matatizo na Kifaa mahususi, hifadhi tena Kifaa hicho ili kujenga upya Kache yake ya Poller. Pia kuna kiolesura cha mstari wa amri kinacholingana na amri hii ambacho kinapendekezwa kwa mifumo mikubwa."

#: utilities.php
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "TAARIFA: Kwenye mifumo mikubwa, amri hii inaweza kuchukua dakika kadhaa hadi saa kukamilika na kwa hivyo haipaswi kuendeshwa kutoka kwa Kiolesura cha Cacti. Unaweza kuendesha tu 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' kwenye mstari wa amri kwa maelezo zaidi."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Jenga Upya Kache ya Rasilimali"

#: utilities.php
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Unapoendesha Wakusanyaji Data wengi katika Cacti, Cacti itajaribu kudumisha hali ya faili muhimu kwenye Wakusanyaji Data wote. Hii inajumuisha faili zote za msingi, zisizohusiana na usakinishaji za tovuti na programu-jalizi. Unapolazimisha ujenzi upya wa Kache ya Rasilimali, Cacti itafuta Kache ya Rasilimali ya ndani, na kisha kuijenga upya wakati mwingine poller itakapoanza kama ilivyoratibiwa. Hii itawafanya Wakusanyaji Data wa Mbali wote kukagua tena faili zao za tovuti na programu-jalizi kwa uthabiti."

