#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick will purge all existing Data Source Statistics from the Database.  If Data Source Statistics is enabled, the Data Sources Statistics will start collection again on the next Data Collector pass."
msgstr "Chaguo hili la menyu litafuta Takwimu zote zilizopo za Chanzo cha Data kutoka kwenye Hifadhidata. Ikiwa Takwimu za Chanzo cha Data zimewezeshwa, Takwimu za Vyanzo vya Data zitaanza kukusanywa tena katika awamu inayofuata ya Mkusanyaji Data."

#: utilities.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Utilities"
msgstr "Zana za Wakala wa SNMP"

#: utilities.php
msgid "This shows all objects being handled by the SNMP Agent."
msgstr "Hii inaonyesha vipengee vyote vinavyoshughulikiwa na Wakala wa SNMP."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild SNMP Agent Cache"
msgstr "Jenga Upya Kache ya Wakala wa SNMP"

#: utilities.php
msgid "The SNMP cache will be cleared and re-generated if you select this option. Note that it takes another poller run to restore the SNMP cache completely."
msgstr "Kache ya SNMP itafutwa na kuzalishwa upya ukichagua chaguo hili. Kumbuka kuwa inachukua uendeshaji mwingine wa poller kurejesha kache ya SNMP kikamilifu."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view the latest events SNMP Agent has handled in relation to the registered notification receivers."
msgstr "Chaguo hili la menyu linakuwezesha kutazama matukio ya hivi karibuni ambayo Wakala wa SNMP ameshughulikia kuhusiana na wapokeaji arifa waliosajiliwa."

